e Warranty\n- Insulated Fiberglass Front Door\n- LED Lighting\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- MSI Granite Countertops\n- Stainless Steel Undermount Sink\n- ½ hp Badger Garbage Disposal\n- 36” Raised Panel Ash Cabinets for 9ft Ceilings/42” for 10 ft Ceilings\n- Kitchen Backsplash - 6 x 6 Ceramic Backsplash\n- Moen Brushed Nickel Faucet\n- GE Energy Star Appliances—Dishwasher\*\n- 30” Electric Range, and Combo Micro/Vent Hood\n- In select plans\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Bath Tile to Ceiling for Master Bath\n- Glass in Master Shower / Soaking Tub per plan\n- Secondary Baths-Wall Tile 8'' with Steel Tub\n- 36” Base Vanity Cabinets in Master Bath & 30” in Second Bath\n- Granite Countertops\n- Moen Faucets\n- Elongated Toilets\n- Schluter Edge Profile for all Bath Tile in Brushed Aluminum\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- 1-2-10 Major Structural Warranty\n- Pre-Construction Orientation\n- Pre-Drywall Meeting\n- Pre-Closing Inspection\n- Post Move In Meeting\n- Online Interactive Customer Portal\n','\n',char(10)),replace('**Texas Gas Service** <https://www.texasgasservice.com/>\n800-700-2443\n','\n',char(10)),replace('Greenfield Communications\n\n<http://egreenfield.com/>\n1-888-230-0020\n','\n',char(10)),replace('City of Mission Water Department\n\n<https://missiontexas.us/city-departments/utility-billing-collections/>\n956-580-8660\n','\n',char(10)),replace('**AEP and your choice of your provider** <https://www.aep.com/>\n877-373-4858\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/rec4nvhmkSZGAeSv8/a0MhXxM4DkqSyrn_1XGSHVr776ImXHB3QbeWfatrBPY',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/rec4nvhmkSZGAeSv8/IdIrq5sBQvcrVFJY-eDnY4cwsequAt6yJXVg6d2tqOc',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/rec4nvhmkSZGAeSv8/8cncS3CajdHLIgATgqPPhzbKY1tJZX1bmtxTKeFE5hc',NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/rec4nvhmkSZGAeSv8/x5bk5OsaE1JiIV7HD6cNkRC5hG-RnyufTlZ8