 home and community for your growing family!\n- Average Homesites: 8,500 sq ft.\n- Choose among 13 award-winning floor plans built in a Tuscan, Contemporary, Traditional or Farmhouse elevation.\n- Smart Home Technology including security systems, lighting controls, garage door monitors, and smartphone apps for remote control\n- Secured community surveillance cameras and individual monitoring capability','\n',char(10)),replace('- IDEA Tres Lagos\n- Lake\n- Playground\n- Park\n- Tri-level tanning terrace\n- Huge Swimming Pool\n- Covered Pool Decks\n- Indoor Fitness Center\n- Large Clubhouse with kitchen and common space\n- Smart Home Technology\n- Over 100 acres of lakes for fishing and paddle boarding\n- Planned interface with police and fire departments for quicker response times\n- First Fiber to Home Community in South Texas\n- Walking distance to over 3,000 acres of state, federal, and city parks\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Edinburg CISD\n- Anne L Magee Elementary School\n- Elias Longoria Sr Middle School\n- Robert R Vela High School\n- IDEA Tres Lagos\n- Texas A&M Higher Education Center at McAllen\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Design Consultation and On-Site Design Center\n- Large Selection of Choices, Colors and Finishes\n- Award Winning Architectural Designs\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Engineered Foundation and Windstorm Plans\n- 100% Masonry Exterior (Stucco, Rock or Brick per plan)\n- Screens on all Operable Windows\n- Underground Utilities\n- Exterior Paint—Sherwin Williams\n- Subterranean Termite Treatment\n- James Hardie Fiber Cement Soffits and Fascia (50 yr warranty)\n- 2-Car Garage\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Smoke Detectors w/ Battery Backup\n- 1- Story Plans: 9'' Ceilings\n- 2 - Story Plans: First Floor - 9'' Ceilings, Second Floor - 9'' Ceilings\n- Ceramic Tile in all Standard Areas -\n- (1st Floor Common/Living, Bathrooms, Utility, Casita)\n- Carpet in all Non-Standard Areas -\n- (Bedrooms, Study, Loft, Gameroom, Media, 2nd Floor Common/Living)\n- Stained Oak Staircase with Painted Risers\n- Stained Oak Handrail with Painted Balusters\n- Interior Paint—Sherwin Williams\n- Liftmaster Garage Door Opener\n- Upgraded Lighting Package by Illuminations\n- Molded Panel Interior Doors\n- CAT6 in Master and Living Room\n- RG6 in all rooms\n- Rounded Corners Throughout Home\n- Ceiling Fans in Master Bedroom and Family Room\n- All other Bedrooms Blocked and Wired for Fans\n- Custom Built Staircase with Pine Spindles\n- Textured Walls\n- Handcrafted Wood Cabinets\n- Shoe mold included with baseboard in all non-carpeted areas (excluding concrete areas)\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Fully Sodded Front & Side Yards to Fence—Carpet Grass\n- 2 Trees & 11 Shrubs in Front Yard- Upgrades Available\n- 6’ Rear Yard Sealed Wood Fence all around\n- Full Front and Backyard Irrigation System utilizing Reuse Water\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Energy Star Certified Home\n- Natural Gas Service to Each Home\n- Navien NPE Tankless Water Heater\n- LowE Insulated Double Pane Windows with Argon Gas\n- Spray Foam Insulation\n- Lennox Variable-Speed Air Handler/Humidity Control\n- High Efficiency Electric 15.2 SEER2 Air Conditioning\n- R-6 Insulated Air Conditioning Box Duct Work\n- Poly Sealant around Windows, Doors and Plates\n- Lifetime Owens Corning TrueDef Roof Shingles\n- Insulated Fiberglass Front Door\n- LED Lighting\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- MSI Granite Countertops\n- 20 gauge Stainless Steel Undermount Sink\n- ½ hp Badger Garbage Disposal\n- 36” Raised Panel Ash Cabinets for 9ft Ceilings/42” for 10 ft Ceilings\n- Kitchen Backsplash—6x6 Ceramic Backsplash\n- Moen Faucet\n- GE Energy Star Appliances—Dishwasher,\n- 30” Electric Range, and Combo Micro/Vent Hood\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Bath Tile to Ceiling for Master Bath\n- Glassed Shower Enclosure; Soaking Tub\n- Secondary Baths - Wall Tile 8'' with Steel Tub\n- 36” Base Vanity Cabinets in Master Bath & 30” in Second Bath\n- MSI Granite Countertops\n- Moen Fixtures\n- Elongated Toilets\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- 1-2-10 Major Structural Warranty\n- Pre-Construction Orientation\n- Pre-Drywall Meeting\n- Pre-Closing Inspection\n- Post Move- In Meeting\n- Online Interactive Customer Portal\n','\n',char(10)),replace('Texas Gas Service\n<https://www.texasgasservice.com/>800-700-2443\n','\n',char(10)),replace('Greenfield Communications\n<http://egreenfield.com/>\n1-888-230-0020\n','\n',char(10)),replace('Sharyland Water Supply\n<https://www.sharylandwater.com/>\n956-585-6081\n','\n',char(10)),replace('Magic Valley Electric Service\n<https://magicvalley.coop/>1-866-225-5683\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recF8bOLQ5fAccm6d/XzEh5G3zRi9m7bvKEDm2-vLyOKVEX_gMOnXCgKTYdTk',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recF8bOLQ5fAccm6d/5Ya4Pd1g0Qwz_WR1xE5I27INmEFO6UCAbnhX162DFIo',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recF8bOLQ5fAccm6d/PMi-XYNi1Y-WdGBOBaIFDjbwjjg3npUMB8a3PsdQGuU',NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recF8bOLQ5fAccm6d/6X4Nipc3Z_YrqDibXRz_v0gqlJsSVUskgPkrSIuDo5U',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recF8bOLQ5fAccm6d/dcAbKn2_j6k6K5wcFu5tXoFZZx7qeW6sCNcC9kRjMvs','https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recF8bOLQ5fAccm6d/kdi1a-U1VZjaRXB3qSIaDa_p-yKXWk6N0fPegujBKsY','https://player.vimeo.com/video/1086095401','956-275-8069','Monday - Saturday: 9:30am to 6:30pm Sunday: 12pm to 6 pm','https://www.esperanzahomes.com/new-homes/tx/mcallen/cascada-at-tres-lagos/7147/#request-a-tour','https://www.houseloan.com/oscarchow/','https://www.allmine.com/store/cascada','https://esperanzahomes.lotvue.com/marketing/Cascada',NULL,NULL,NULL,'rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS','2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-06-06T16:00:31.629Z',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/community/cascada-at-tres-lagos');
