or growing your family, you’ll find a home that fits your lifestyle. Surrounded by local favorites like Hazel Bazemore Park, the Hawkwatch Platform, and River Hills Country Club, Meadow Ridge offers plenty of opportunities to enjoy the outdoors, relax, and stay active—all just minutes from home. \n\n\nBe among the first to experience Esperanza Homes in Corpus Christi. Join the VIP list to receive community updates, pricing, floor plans, and more.  ','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recFy2CELgzpOS7YP/_z_FcEqX0B3yb7YS8p7HshF0FPsB9aqYT4DsLLAu3JU',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'956-275-8069',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://esperanzahomes.lotvue.com/marketing/MeadowRidge',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/community/meadow-ridge');
