oor plans with modern finishes, smart home technology, and fiber connectivity designed to keep you comfortable and connected. Discover the laid-back lifestyle you’ve been waiting for at Villas Las Lagunas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recbbtGBmArXoOY09/OaYrux0AqM5jXv-4O0ArrsAjRm6zHLNS_jrPLO3NRhs',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Monday - Saturday: 9:30am to 6:30pm Sunday: 12pm to 6 pm',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://esperanzahomes.lotvue.com/marketing/VillasLasLagunas',NULL,NULL,NULL,'rectswj3LFp5lwPKu','2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/community/villas-las-lagunas');
