uding IDEA Harlingen Public School and Harlingen CISD. Opportunities for an active lifestyle are just minutes away at the Harlingen Sports Complex and Harlingen National Bronco Park, while convenient access to nearby highways makes commuting simple. A planned community park within Los Arroyos will provide additional green space for families to gather and unwind. Shopping, dining, and everyday essentials are always within reach, with Sam’s Club and a variety of retail and restaurant options just minutes away. \r\n\r\nAt Los Arroyos, you’ll find the perfect blend of location, lifestyle, and livability—all in a welcoming new community designed for the way you live today.','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/rech87vjetLasYVZd/wQOmSyBh__V9WeU7tucKak6UUETkBAlAI6iWdadw6wo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-06-02T13:14:59.394Z',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/community/los-arroyos');
