 Laredo Water Museum\n- Lake Casa Blanca International State Park\n- United South High School\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- United ISD\n- Bonnie Garcia Elementary\n- United South Middle School\n- United South High School\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Design Consultation and On-Site Design Center\n- Large Selection of Choices, Colors and Finishes\n- Award Winning Architectural Designs\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Engineered Foundation and Windstorm Plans\n- Brick Exterior or Stucco Upgrade\n- Screens on all Operable Windows\n- Underground Utilities\n- Exterior Paint—Sherwin Williams\n- Bora-Care with Mold-Care pest treatment\n- Windstorm Designed Plans\n- James Hardie Cement Soffits and Fascia- 50 yr warranty\n- 1 Car Garage\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Smoke Detectors w/Battery Backup\n- Haven 1- Story Plans: 9'' Ceilings 2 - Story Plans: First Floor - 9'' Ceilings, Second Floor - 8'' Ceilings\n- Hearth 1- Story Plans: 9'' Ceilings 2 - Story Plans: First Floor - 9'' Ceilings, Second Floor - 9'' Ceilings\n- Ceramic Tile in all Standard Areas -\n- (1st Floor Common/Living, Bathrooms, Utility, Casita)\n- Carpet in all Non-Standard Areas -\n- (Bedrooms, Study, Loft, Gameroom, Media, 2nd Floor Common/Living)\n- Stained Oak Staircase with Painted Risers\n- Stained Oak Handrail with Painted Balusters\n- Interior Paint—Sherwin Williams\n- Liftmaster Garage Door Opener\n- Lighting package by Illuminations\n- Molded Panel Interior Doors\n- CAT6 in Master and Living Room\n- RG6 in all rooms\n- Rounded Corners Throughout Home\n- Ceiling Fans in Master Bedroom and Family Room\n- All other Bedrooms Blocked and Wired for Fans\n- Handcrafted Wood Cabinets\n- Textured Walls\n- Shoe mold included with baseboard in all non-carpeted areas (excluding concrete areas)\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Front Sodded Yards— St Augustine\n- 2 Trees & 11 Plants- Upgrades Available\n- SOD & Irrigation in front\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Energy Star Qualified Home\n- Navien NPE Tankless Water Heater\n- High Performance LowE Insulated Double Pane Windows\n- Spray Foam Insulation\n- Lennox Variable-Speed Air Handler/Humidity Control\n- High Efficiency Electric 15.2 SEER2 Conditioning\n- R-6 Insulated Air Conditioning Box Duct Work\n- Poly Sealant around Windows, Doors and Plates\n- 30-year Roof Shingles with Owens Corning Lifetime Warranty\n- Insulated Fiberglass Front Door\n- LED Lighting\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Granite Countertops\n- Kitchen Backsplash - 6 x 6 Ceramic Backsplash\n- 20 gauge Stainless Steel Undermount Sink\n- ½ hp Badger Garbage Disposal\n- 36” Raised Panel Ash Cabinets for 9ft Ceilings/42” for 10 ft Ceilings\n- Moen Faucet\n- GE Energy Star Appliances Dishwasher, 30” Electric Range, and combo Micro/ Vent Hood (Black or White)\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- Bath Tile to Ceiling for Master Bath\n- Secondary Baths-Wall Tile 8'' with Steel Tub\n- Pedestal Sink at Powder Bath\n- 36” Base Vanity Cabinets in Master Bath & 30” in Second Bath\n- MSI Granite Countertops\n- Moen Faucets\n- Schluter Edge Profile for all Bath Tile in Brushed Aluminum\n','\n',char(10)),replace('- 1-2-10 Major Structural Warranty\n- Pre-Construction Orientation\n- Pre-Drywall Meeting\n- Pre-Closing Inspection\n- Post Move- In Meeting\n- Online Interactive Customer Portal\n','\n',char(10)),replace('**City of Laredo** <https://laredoutilities.com/>\n956-727-6402\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,replace('City of Laredo\n<https://laredoutilities.com/>\n956-727-6402\n','\n',char(10)),replace('**AEP** <https://www.aeptexas.com/savings/>\n866-223-8508\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recyqsayHRWeIWfaK/bfZB2J7-CRwXZYD5AU1fVYxERoN_dGPmacaan_b4Yx4',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recyqsayHRWeIWfaK/yHae2azQ_fCgA2xMlTa-ye1ndRWOTMwl6daCAyUhGtk',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recyqsayHRWeIWfaK/mTuSI96CSsPILt0qQQ0eX5jTFqVSpldNKgXctoC9HtM',NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recyqsayHRWeIWfaK/1YImtg2Wrx8JsysNr7YKnnoVoW7c_taVdlCWkpxkysI',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recyqsayHRWeIWfaK/FAubMWZPJcYvcNCM5kyifk28be5VouDYARoFTDYFrIA','https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recyqsayHRWeIWfaK/5vFxFdwfrBZffkbbqJC_HpGUKx4FMNPW8DBMVCFzA3U',NULL,'956-275-8069','Monday - Saturday: 9:30am to 6:30pm Sunday: 12pm to 6 pm','https://www.esperanzahomes.com/new-homes/tx/laredo/wright-ranch/15463/#request-a-tour','https://www.houseloan.com/marygalland/',NULL,'https://esperanzahomes.lotvue.com/marketing/Wright%20Ranch',NULL,NULL,NULL,'recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R','2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-06-06T16:01:00.343Z',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/community/wright-ranch');
