 and vision. Whether you''re searching for your first home, growing your family, or looking to downsize without compromising quality, Aquero offers beautiful new homes designed for the way you live.','\n',char(10)),NULL,replace('United ISD\n\n- Fasken Elementary School\n- Juan Ramirez Middle School\n- United High School Main Campus\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,replace('**City of Laredo**  \n[laredoutilities.com](https://laredoutilities.com/)  \n956-727-6402\n','\n',char(10)),replace('**AEP**  \n[aeptexas.com/savings](https://www.aeptexas.com/savings/)  \n866-223-8508\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recg3csKjwsymd3IF/071925_grapa_1404_zurich_ave_01.jpg',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recg3csKjwsymd3IF/012026-benanti-tss-vw055-4923_n._35th_ln_30.jpg',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recg3csKjwsymd3IF/012026-benanti-tss-vw055-4923_n._35th_ln_37_1.jpg',NULL,NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/communities/recg3csKjwsymd3IF/lzywZw0blNqdjxxD6dApPUn27HL3RYIRJc_p0QjFLVk',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'956-275-8069','Monday - Saturday: 9:30am to 6:30pm Sunday: 12pm to 6 pm','https://www.esperanzahomes.com/new-homes/tx/laredo/aquero/19788/#request-a-tour','https://www.houseloan.com/marygalland/',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Allegrini, Cortono, Benanti, Grapa',NULL,'recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R','2026-06-02T07:28:22.921Z','2026-06-05T16:39:40.618Z',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/community/aquero');
INSERT INTO "cities" ("id","community_count","move_in_homes_count","floor_plans_count","city_name","slug","state","status","map_latitude","map_longitude","hero_image_url","hero_description","national_recognition","incentive","city_copy_blocks_json","city_venue_blocks_json","created_at","updated_at","custom_fields","published","coming_soon") VALUES('rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS',8,99,67,'McAllen','mcallen','TX','Active',26.2034,-98.23,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/1IQ6I9G14n_W9bdII_VM2hjho7Sd18cEymoI2T8o_CM','Welcome to the City of McAllen, Texas. Known for its warm climate, rich cultural heritage, and thriving economy, McAllen offers a high quality of life that continues to attract new residents and businesses. With a unique blend of big-city amenities and small-town charm, the city has it all. It is home to top-rated schools, diverse shopping and dining options, and a strong job market in industries like healthcare, education, manufacturing and retail.','Ranked the second-best place to live in Texas by U.S. News & World Report (2024-2025), McAllen also boasts the lowest cost of living in the U.S. and a strong ''AA+'' credit rating from Fitch.',NULL,'{"homes_heading":"Our Homes in McAllen","homes_description":"Esperanza Homes builds in McAllen''s most sought-after communities, offering beautifully designed, high-quality, energy-efficient homes to suit every lifestyle. With our E-Difference—E-Connected, E-Efficient, E-Simplicity, and E-Customization—you''ll enjoy smart technology, lower utility costs and a personalized homebuying experience in a city where everything is at your fingertips.","live_in_heading":"Live in McAllen, Texas","live_in_description":"Find your dream home in our numerous McAllen Communities! From Campo de Suenos to Tres Lagos, we have options for every lifestyle.","live_in_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/072123_Monte_Traditional_Brick.jpg","image_0":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/Capture-2026-05-22-151855.png","section_1_title":"A Celebration of Culture and Heritage","section_1_description":"What truly sets the City of McAllen apart is its unique cultural scene. With a rich mix of Mexican and American influences, the city offers a vibrant and colorful blend of art, music, food, and traditions that celebrate its heritage and diversity. From mariachi festivals and Tex-Mex cuisine to museums and historical landmarks, there is always something to explore and discover in McAllen.","section_1_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/McAllenSee_1.jpg","section_1a_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/Capture-2026-05-22-151902.png","section_2_title":"A Highly Rated City","section_2_description":"McAllen receives national recognition for affordability, economic strength, and business friendliness. Ranked second-best place to live in Texas by U.S. News & World Report (2024-2025), the city also boasts the lowest cost of living in the U.S. and a strong ''AA+'' credit rating from Fitch.","section_2_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/0If6DhXhtS8hYDljVCk0FhWiZeDvrm-UeuNRzPU7qxI","section_3_title":"Life in McAllen, Texas","section_3_description":"McAllen has a vibrant mix of dining, entertainment and relaxation. From beautiful and informative museums, bird watching, and family filled events happening across the city, McAllen has it all. Read on to discover a few of our favorites.","section_3_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/UwgBrDOlyUoaoDqOyONqhKjRDvTmPXgMjohTMuAM6qQ","pillar_1_title":"PRIME LOCATION","pillar_1_description":"Easy access to expressways, top schools, shopping, and entertainment.","pillar_2_title":"VIBRANT CULTURE","pillar_2_description":"A rich heritage, lively art scene, and family-friendly atmosphere. From authentic Mexican cuisine to the McAllen Holiday Parade, there is nothing like McAllen.","pillar_3_title":"MORE HOME FOR YOUR MONEY","pillar_3_description":"McAllen''s lower cost of living means homebuyers get greater value without sacrificing quality.","pillar_4_title":"WE LOVE THE VALLEY","pillar_4_description":"Our roots are in the Rio Grande Valley and the City of McAllen is at the heart of the RGV."}','{"eat_venues":"[Barry''s Bistro Bar & Grill McAllen](https://barrysbistro.com/mcallen/)\n[Santa Fe Steakhouse & Cantina](https://santafemcallen.com/)\n[Salt](https://saltnewamericantable.com/home/)\n[Diegos Food Truck](https://www.instagram.com/diegosfoodtruck_/?hl=en)\n","eat_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/McAllenEat_1.jpg","shop_venues":"[La Plaza Mall](https://www.exploremcallen.com/shopping/la-plaza-mall/)\n[Downtown McAllen](https://www.exploremcallen.com/shopping/business-district/)\n","shop_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/McAllen_shop.jpg","play_venues":"[McAllen Performing Arts Center and Convention Center](https://experiencemcallen.com/)\n[Veteran''s War Memorial](https://www.mcallen.net/veterans/)\n[McAllen Public Library](https://www.mcallenlibrary.net/)\n[International Museum of Art & Science](https://theimasonline.org/)\n[The McAllen Heritage Center](https://www.mcallenheritagecenter.com/)\n","play_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/McAllenSee1_1.jpg","relax_venues":"[Quinta Mazatlan](https://www.quintamazatlan.com/)\n[McAllen Nature Center](https://www.exploremcallen.com/things-to-do/parks-outdoors/mcallen-nature-center/)\n","relax_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec0I2e5cRqFGuryS/McAllenRelax2_1.jpg"}','2026-05-31T01:05:16.822Z','2026-05-31T02:25:41.182Z',NULL,1,0);
INSERT INTO "cities" ("id","community_count","move_in_homes_count","floor_plans_count","city_name","slug","state","status","map_latitude","map_longitude","hero_image_url","hero_description","national_recognition","incentive","city_copy_blocks_json","city_venue_blocks_json","created_at","updated_at","custom_fields","published","coming_soon") VALUES('rec3ayR5C7auSoShG',1,13,32,'Harlingen','harlingen','TX','Active',26.1906,-97.6961,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/IVhEyALU04V0XVOujZ2QqTOmeMPIkNTdR1Cox5FfwS0','Known for its warm climate and friendly community, the city''s economy centers on agriculture, healthcare, and tourism, it is also home to several medical facilities and Valley International Airport, and it is located only 30 miles from the Gulf of America and South Padre Island.',NULL,NULL,'{"homes_heading":"Our Homes in Harlingen","homes_description":"Esperanza Homes builds beautifully crafted, energy-efficient homes in Harlingen. With close access to major highways, the airport and the coast, Harlingen is an ideal place to live, work and explore. Our E-Difference—E-Connected, E-Efficient, E-Simplicity, and E-Customization—brings smart technology, energy savings, and a personalized homebuying experience to this vibrant and growing city.","live_in_heading":"Live in Harlingen, Texas","live_in_description":"Find your dream home at Paso Real, a vibrant and welcoming neighborhood.","live_in_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/HarlingenEat_1.jpg","image_0":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/HarlingenSee_1.jpg","section_1_title":"A Celebration of Culture and Heritage","section_1_description":"Harlingen''s rich history comes to life through its museums, landmarks, and annual festivals. The Harlingen Arts and Heritage Museum showcases the city''s past, while the Iwo Jima Memorial Monument honors its military significance.","section_1_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/HarlingenShop.jpg","section_1a_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/HarlingenSee3_MdRV83m.jpg","section_2_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","section_2_description":"Harlingen boasts a range of recreational activities and attractions in its numerous parks and trails. The city offers rich birding opportunities with the World Birding Center and Harlingen hosts events like the Rio Grande Valley Birding Festival.","section_2_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/ZbTUdEL-BFGMshtuUT9-LIr5oHHKBo7eprz57OheuLU","section_3_title":"Life in Harlingen, Texas","section_3_description":"Harlingen has great shopping, dining and entertainment options. Read on to discover more of our favorites.","section_3_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/HBBHidby-bYNmqfxZr3_sISllv80lnH4Eqp_6NAGHU8","pillar_1_title":"Prime Location","pillar_1_description":"Harlingen offers easy access to the coast, the Rio Grande Valley and Mexico.","pillar_2_title":"Rich Culture & Heritage","pillar_2_description":"Popular with Winter Texans and retirees, Harlingen has a friendly atmosphere with rich cultural roots.","pillar_3_title":"More Home for Your Money","pillar_3_description":"Harlingen provides stability and opportunity for residents.","pillar_4_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","pillar_4_description":"With scenic parks, trails, and world-class birding, Harlingen is perfect for nature lovers."}','{"eat_venues":"[La Playa Mexican Cafe](https://www.laplayamexicancafe.com/)\n[Las Vegas Cafe](https://www.facebook.com/people/Las-Vegas-Cafe/100063766682299/)\n[Colletti''s Italian Restaurant](https://collettis.net/)\n","eat_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/HarlingenEat2_1.jpg","shop_venues":"[Downtown Harlingen](https://texastimetravel.com/directory/downtown-harlingen/)\n[Bass Pro Shop](https://stores.basspro.com/us/tx/harlingen/101-bass-pro-dr.html)\n[Walmart Supercenter](https://www.walmart.com/store/595-harlingen-tx/)\n[Target](https://www.target.com/sl/harlingen/802)\n","shop_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/HarlingenShop.jpg","play_venues":"[Harlingen Arts and Heritage Museum](https://www.harlingentx.gov/community/harlingen_arts___heritage_museum.php)\n[Iwo Jima Memorial Monument](https://thc.texas.gov/historic-sites/iwo-jima-museum-and-monument)\n[Rio Grande Valley Birding Festival](https://rgvbf.org/)\n","play_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/HarlingenSee_2.jpg","relax_venues":"[Arroyo Colorado Hike & Bike Trail](https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/texas/arroyo-hike-and-bike-trail)\n[Harlingen City Lake & Liberty Gardens](https://www.harlingentx.gov/business_detail_T34_R286.php)\n[Laguna Atascosa National Wildlife Refuge](https://www.fws.gov/refuge/laguna-atascosa)\n","relax_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/rec3ayR5C7auSoShG/HarlingenRelax_1.jpg"}','2026-05-31T01:05:16.822Z','2026-05-31T02:25:41.182Z',NULL,1,0);
INSERT INTO "cities" ("id","community_count","move_in_homes_count","floor_plans_count","city_name","slug","state","status","map_latitude","map_longitude","hero_image_url","hero_description","national_recognition","incentive","city_copy_blocks_json","city_venue_blocks_json","created_at","updated_at","custom_fields","published","coming_soon") VALUES('recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R',7,60,22,'Laredo','laredo','TX','Active',27.5036,-99.5076,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/K4msQkBmMEYfEs_sPG1g2czslinKCmro5P_2dDcONos','Laredo blends American and Mexican cultures seamlessly due to its unique location along the Rio Grande River in South Texas. Ranked as one of the safest cities by WalletHub, Laredo offers a great place to live, work and raise a family. With its strong sense of community, cultural vibrancy, and easy access to Mexico, Laredo creates an exceptional place to live and experience a unique way of life.','Ranked as one of the safest cities by WalletHub.',NULL,'{"homes_heading":"Our Homes in Laredo","homes_description":"Esperanza Homes builds quality, energy-efficient homes in Laredo. With its strong sense of community, prime location along the border, and access to schools, shopping, and recreation, Laredo is an ideal place to live. Through our E-Difference—E-Connected, E-Efficient, E-Simplicity, and E-Customization—we bring smart features, energy savings and a personalized homebuying experience to this growing and family-friendly city.","live_in_heading":"Live in Laredo, Texas","live_in_description":"Find your dream home in our numerous Laredo Communities! From Antlers Cross, El Eden, Wolf Creek, Wright Ranch and Villas San Agustin, discover the Esperanza Homes E-Difference.","live_in_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/LaredoContent2_1.jpg","image_0":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/LaredoContent_1.jpg","section_1_title":"A Celebration of Culture and Heritage","section_1_description":"Laredo''s rich history is reflected in its architecture, museums and annual events such as the George Washington birthday celebration. There is a vibrant food scene as traditional Mexican flavors combined with Texas style food make Laredo food unforgettable.","section_1_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/LaredoContent1_1.jpg","section_1a_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/Laredo_Content.jpg","section_2_title":"Outdoor Fun and Sun","section_2_description":"The city''s tropical weather provides an inviting atmosphere for relaxation, outdoor activities and vibrant community events. Laredo''s natural beauty and recreational opportunities are equally remarkable for this lively border town. Birding enthusiasts are drawn to its trails, which showcase rare species and native flora in their natural habitat. The nearby Lake Casa Blanca International State Park offers fishing, boating, and picnicking, adding to the city''s outdoor appeal.","section_2_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/wko8hinWOeGIZMVKlYum8rrhULgZ8_dd792xZQP_EmE","section_3_title":"Life in Laredo, Texas","section_3_description":"Laredo blends history, culture, and outdoor adventure. From festive events to scenic parks and amazing Tex-Mex, there''s always something to enjoy. Read on to discover a few of our favorites.","section_3_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/0VtV8VDRM2oSbDwvW1ZDCCoYRyx0VCD2hOCOX2YBYQI","pillar_1_title":"Strong Community & Safety","pillar_1_description":"Ranked as one of the safest cities, Laredo offers a welcoming environment ideal for families and professionals.","pillar_2_title":"Rich Culture & Heritage","pillar_2_description":"Laredo''s deep-rooted history, vibrant traditions, and annual celebrations make it a unique and lively place to call home.","pillar_3_title":"More Home for Your Money","pillar_3_description":"As a major trade hub with a strong job market, Laredo provides excellent opportunities for homeowners and businesses alike.","pillar_4_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","pillar_4_description":"With year-round warm weather, scenic parks, and nature trails, Laredo is perfect for those who love the outdoors."}','{"eat_venues":"[El Capataz](http://el-capataz.com/)\n[Tabernilla](https://www.tabernillalaredo.com/)\n","eat_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/LaredoEat_1.jpg","shop_venues":"[The Outlet Shoppes at Laredo](https://www.theoutletshoppesatlaredo.com/)\n[Mall del Norte](https://www.malldelnorte.com/)\n","shop_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/LaredoShop_1.jpg","play_venues":"[Republic of the Rio Grande Museum](https://webbheritage.org/Republic-of-the-Rio-Grande-Museum)\n[San Augustin Plaza](https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g56137-d144363-Reviews-San_Augustin_Plaza-Laredo_Texas.html)\n[Slaughter Park](https://laredoparksandrec.com/laredo-fields/slaughter-sports-complex/)\n","play_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/LaredoSee.jpg","relax_venues":"[Lake Casa Blanca International State Park](https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/lake-casa-blanca)\n","relax_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/LaredoRelax_1.jpg","stay_venues":"[Residence Inn Laredo Del Mar](https://www.marriott.com/en-us/hotels/lrdri-residence-inn-laredo-del-mar/overview/)\n[Family Garden Inn & Suites](https://www.familygardeninn.com/)\n","stay_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recEOgxOqVYTGsy1R/LaredoStay_1.jpg"}','2026-05-31T01:05:16.822Z','2026-05-31T02:25:41.182Z',NULL,1,0);
INSERT INTO "cities" ("id","community_count","move_in_homes_count","floor_plans_count","city_name","slug","state","status","map_latitude","map_longitude","hero_image_url","hero_description","national_recognition","incentive","city_copy_blocks_json","city_venue_blocks_json","created_at","updated_at","custom_fields","published","coming_soon") VALUES('recI7M9OBNptOGaes',1,12,19,'San Juan','san-juan','TX','Active',26.1893,-98.1553,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/LyTJD_YdCoHTghZHbA6gYYARBA8yRuUvQxQk8ZwNLbE','Welcome to the City of San Juan, Texas! Known as the ''The Friendly City,'' San Juan offers a close-knit community with easy access to the larger McAllen-Edinburg-Mission Metropolitan Area. With a rich heritage, vibrant local culture and growing opportunities, San Juan is an ideal place to call home.','Home to one of the largest collections of stained-glass windows in the United States',NULL,'{"homes_heading":"Our Homes in San Juan","homes_description":"Esperanza Homes builds in San Juan''s welcoming communities with beautifully crafted, energy-efficient homes. The builder offers smart technology, lower energy costs, and personalized homebuying experiences through E-Connected, E-Efficient, E-Simplicity, and E-Customization benefits.","live_in_heading":"Live in San Juan, Texas","live_in_description":"Discover Stewart Coves in San Juan, Texas!","live_in_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/SanJuanSee_1.jpg","image_0":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/SanJuanSee2_1.jpg","section_1_title":"Heritage of Faith","section_1_description":"San Juan is known for the Basilica of the National Shrine of Our Lady of San Juan del Valle, one of the largest churches in South Texas with tens of thousands of visitors every year. The city is also home to the Gelman Stained Glass Museum which showcases one of the largest collections of stained-glass windows in the United States.","section_1_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/SanJuanSee2_2.jpg","section_1a_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/SanJuanSee_1.jpg","section_2_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","section_2_description":"With warm, year-round weather San Juan offers an outdoor lifestyle. Residents enjoy sports and recreation at the numerous city parks.","section_2_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/gdC8rSZexAQ0LuhcKxp3zeyTQbP3PqQe2vCFZkw19B8","section_3_title":"Life in San Juan, Texas","section_3_description":"San Juan is perfectly positioned to enjoy the best of the Rio Grande Valley food, entertainment and shopping. Read on to discover a few of our favorites.","section_3_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/EemMywPOdun_WYEoHDWqDiaJyItSt-d7tVQ04QKJNY","pillar_1_title":"Strong Sense of Community","pillar_1_description":"San Juan is a welcoming city where neighbors feel like family.","pillar_2_title":"Rich Culture & Heritage","pillar_2_description":"Home to the iconic Basilica and Gelman Stained Glass Museum.","pillar_3_title":"Prime Location","pillar_3_description":"Easy access to McAllen, Pharr, Edinburg, and Mission for work, dining and entertainment.","pillar_4_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","pillar_4_description":"Year-round warm weather and plenty of parks for recreation."}','{"eat_venues":"[El Rancho Grande Mexican Restaurant and Cantina](https://www.facebook.com/p/El-Rancho-Grande-Restaurant-100063536323290/)\n[Michael''s Burgers & More](https://www.facebook.com/p/Michaels-Burgers-More-61556436301030/)\n[Sabor De Acayucan](https://www.instagram.com/sabor_de_acayucan/)\n","eat_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/SanJuanEat1_1.jpg","shop_venues":"[Costco - Pharr](https://www.costco.com/warehouse-locations/pharr-tx-1108.html)\n","shop_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/brFoVR_n.jpeg","play_venues":"[Basilica of Our Lady of San Juan del Valle National Shrine](https://www.olsjbasilica.org/)\n[Gelman Stained Glass Museum](https://www.gelmanmuseum.org/)\n","play_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/SanJuanSee_1.jpg","relax_venues":"[San Juan Firemans Park](https://sanjuan.recdesk.com/Community/Facility/Detail?facilityId=32)\n[San Juan Municipal Park](https://sanjuan.recdesk.com/Community/Facility/Detail?facilityId=5)\n","relax_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recI7M9OBNptOGaes/SanJuanPharrRelax2.jpg"}','2026-05-31T01:05:16.822Z','2026-05-31T02:25:41.182Z',NULL,1,0);
INSERT INTO "cities" ("id","community_count","move_in_homes_count","floor_plans_count","city_name","slug","state","status","map_latitude","map_longitude","hero_image_url","hero_description","national_recognition","incentive","city_copy_blocks_json","city_venue_blocks_json","created_at","updated_at","custom_fields","published","coming_soon") VALUES('recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi',5,42,54,'Edinburg','edinburg','TX','Active',26.3017,-98.1633,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/_N0-FrDGsU6eh1vRBSRUhNCWO__WlMbUCo757_1oq5c','Welcome to the City of Edinburg, Texas! Located in the heart of the Rio Grande Valley, Edinburg offers historic Spanish colonial architecture, local museums, University of Texas Rio Grande Valley, scenic nature spots, and even a UFO Festival.',NULL,NULL,'{"homes_heading":"Our Homes in Edinburg","homes_description":"Esperanza Homes builds energy-efficient residences in Edinburg with comfort and value. The E-Difference—E-Connected, E-Efficient, E-Simplicity, and E-Customization—provides smart technology, long-term savings, and personalized homebuying in a culturally rich South Texas community.","live_in_heading":"Live in Edinburg, Texas","live_in_description":"Explore our three exceptional communities in Edinburg: Rogers Coves, Villas on Freddy and Silos at La Sienna, all offering modern homes and a great location.","live_in_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/EdinburgR_1.jpg","image_0":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/Edinburg_-_UTRGV_2.jpg","section_1_title":"A City of Education","section_1_description":"The University of Texas Rio Grande Valley''s main campus is located in Edinburg, making the city a hub for higher education, research and innovation. Edinburg also supports lifelong learning through its public libraries, symphony and museums such as the Museum of South Texas History.","section_1_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/EdinburgContent_1.jpg","section_1a_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/EdinburgSee_1.jpg","section_2_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","section_2_description":"With its warm and sunny weather, there are plenty of opportunities to enjoy the great outdoors year-round. Take a hike in the Edinburg Scenic Wetlands and World Birding Center. Explore La Sal del Rey, an ancient salt lake, once used by indigenous people and Spanish settlers for trade.","section_2_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/7t6zr-xCV8MmYD_fTtl31YEEGQ9PqOSj17OBkTKaksU","section_3_title":"Life in Edinburg, Texas","section_3_description":"Edinburg has a rich blend of history, culture, food and outdoor recreation. Read on to discover a few of our favorites.","section_3_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/xJV4bhXLGLoboi2y2OZcU0ts9JqLZn9hIcIWDnLi_NM","pillar_1_title":"Strong Education Center","pillar_1_description":"Home to the University of Texas Rio Grande Valley, Edinburg fosters education, research, and innovation, making it an ideal place for students and professionals.","pillar_2_title":"Rich Culture & Heritage","pillar_2_description":"From historic sites and museums to local festivals and a vibrant arts scene, Edinburg embraces its history while celebrating the future.","pillar_3_title":"Thriving Community","pillar_3_description":"As a rapidly expanding city, Edinburg offers a strong economy, job opportunities, and a welcoming atmosphere for families and businesses.","pillar_4_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle and Entertainment","pillar_4_description":"Residents enjoy year-round outdoor activities from nature preserves to supporting the UTRGV Vaqueros and attending events at the Bert Ogden Arena."}','{"eat_venues":"[Lucky Sushi Bar](http://www.luckysushibar.net/)\n[Trevino''s Restaurant](https://www.facebook.com/people/Trevinos-Restaurant/100064103321272/)\n[Sidebar](https://www.sidebar215.com/)\n","eat_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/EdinburgEat.jpg","shop_venues":"The Shoppes at Rio Grande Valley\n","shop_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/EdinburgShop_1.jpg","play_venues":"[Museum Of South Texas History](https://mosthistory.org/)\n[South Texas Motorcycle Museum](https://stxmm.net/)\n[Dustin Michael Sekula Library](https://cityofedinburg.com/departments/library_cultural_arts/index.php)\n[Bert Ogden Arena](https://bertogdenarena.com/)\n[Valley Symphony Orchestra](https://www.valleysymphony.org/)\n[UFO Festival](https://cityofedinburg.com/ufo_festival/index.php)\n","play_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/EdinburgSee2.jpg","relax_venues":"[Edinburg Scenic Wetlands and World Birding Center](https://edinburgwbc.org/)\n[La Sal del Rey](https://texastimetravel.com/directory/la-sal-del-rey/)\n[Freddy Gonzalez Park Splash Playground](https://cityofedinburg.com/departments/parks_and_recreation/parks_division.php)\n","relax_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recLfQGdbcgD8iTCi/EdinburgContent_2.jpg"}','2026-05-31T01:05:16.822Z','2026-05-31T02:25:41.182Z',NULL,1,0);
INSERT INTO "cities" ("id","community_count","move_in_homes_count","floor_plans_count","city_name","slug","state","status","map_latitude","map_longitude","hero_image_url","hero_description","national_recognition","incentive","city_copy_blocks_json","city_venue_blocks_json","created_at","updated_at","custom_fields","published","coming_soon") VALUES('recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj',1,21,4,'Mercedes','mercedes','TX','Active',26.1499,-97.9136,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/kvDl62x8_SnXJpUmRTInlQN0pRq1chByebByL0dUDZI','Welcome to the City of Mercedes, Texas! Proudly known as ''The Queen City of the Valley,'' this beautiful city is renowned for its historical background and proximity to the Progreso-Nuevo Progreso International Bridge. Home to the region''s largest outlet mall, one of Texas'' top 10 livestock shows, and a unique public art display featuring handcrafted alma mater cowboy boot statues throughout the city, Mercedes offers something for everyone.','One of Texas'' top 10 livestock shows',NULL,'{"homes_heading":"Our Homes in Mercedes","homes_description":"Esperanza Homes builds quality, energy-efficient homes in Mercedes. With its strong sense of community, and access to schools, shopping, and recreation, Laredo is an ideal place to live. Through our E-Difference—E-Connected, E-Efficient, E-Simplicity, and E-Customization—we bring smart features, energy savings and a personalized homebuying experience to this growing and family-friendly city.","live_in_heading":"Live in Mercedes, Texas","live_in_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/Mercedes_Boots_UTRGV.jpg","image_0":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/MercedesSee_6.jpg","section_1_title":"A Celebration of Culture and Heritage","section_1_description":"The Veterans War Memorial at Mercedes City Hall honors local veterans while reflecting the city''s deep cultural roots. Founded in 1907, Mercedes, TX was one of the first cities in the Rio Grande Valley, shaped by early irrigation and agriculture.","section_1_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/MercedesRelax_2.jpg","section_1a_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/Mercedes_WesMer_Drive_In.png","section_2_title":"Heart of the Valley","section_2_description":"From rodeos and fairs to food festivals, this community is the heartbeat of local events. It offers green spaces, walking trails, playgrounds, splash pads, and basketball courts—plenty of room for kids to play and families to relax. It''s the perfect laid-back spot for weekend picnics, open play, and enjoying the shade.","section_2_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/9vQXjsNJ1LW4iDm_CRoV3vQB3fnVyoMd978HcVwyq14","section_3_title":"Life in Mercedes, Texas","section_3_description":"Mercedes offers food, entertainment and more. Read on to discover a few of our favorites.","section_3_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/KFgfb78k10_82ikb9ILHrD5hJn7rOaWOBbuScET0VwM","pillar_1_title":"Community & Trusted Safety","pillar_1_description":"Mercedes, TX, is recognized for its strong community spirit and low crime rates, making it one of the safer cities.","pillar_2_title":"Building Comfort and Community","pillar_2_description":"Esperanza Homes is helping make Mercedes a top choice for those seeking comfortable living in a welcoming community.","pillar_3_title":"The Queen City of the Valley","pillar_3_description":"Best of all, it''s conveniently located just minutes from everything that matters most to you.","pillar_4_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","pillar_4_description":"Enjoy green spaces, walking trails, playgrounds, and scenic boardwalks that offer plenty of room to relax, play, and explore a birdwatching paradise."}','{"eat_venues":"[Formacio Pizza](https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100077066243592)\n[Chili''s Grill & Bar](https://www.chilis.com/locations/us/texas/mercedes/mercedes)\n[Moran''s Pizzeria](https://drive.google.com/file/d/13LTmH0KHaUl-83YTtX13QAbvI74rn3dn/view)\n","eat_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/Mercedes_Morans_Pizza.jpg","shop_venues":"[Rio Grande Valley Premium Outlets](https://www.premiumoutlets.com/outlet/rio-grande-valley)\n[Camargo''s Western Boots](https://www.facebook.com/camargoboots/)\nDowntown Mercedes\n","shop_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/Mercedes_RGV_Outlets.png","play_venues":"[Mercedes City Park](https://www.cityofmercedes.com/culture-recreation/parks/)\n[Llano Grande Resort & Golf Club](https://www.llanogranderesort.com/golfing/)\n[Annual RGV Livestock Show & Rodeo](https://www.rgvls.com/)\n[Downtown Mercedes Boot Map](https://mercedesedc.com/boot-map)\n","play_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/Mercdes_Golf_Course.jpeg","relax_venues":"[Estero Llano Grande State Park](https://www.facebook.com/esterollano/)\n[Wes-Mer Drive-In Theater](https://www.wesmerdrivein.com/)\n","relax_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recVBRTlr9d6GBZOj/MercedesRelax_2_MllQwCE.jpg"}','2026-05-31T01:05:16.822Z','2026-05-31T02:25:41.182Z',NULL,1,0);
INSERT INTO "cities" ("id","community_count","move_in_homes_count","floor_plans_count","city_name","slug","state","status","map_latitude","map_longitude","hero_image_url","hero_description","national_recognition","incentive","city_copy_blocks_json","city_venue_blocks_json","created_at","updated_at","custom_fields","published","coming_soon") VALUES('recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4',1,13,18,'Weslaco','weslaco','TX','Active',26.1596,-97.9908,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/5DlH2t8XiR6_O8s4vFqO6uud_Ro52wTPw_MJdKiQRto','Welcome to the City of Weslaco, Texas! From the historic downtown district to the local museums and art galleries, there''s always something new to discover in this city.',NULL,NULL,'{"homes_heading":"Our Homes in Weslaco","homes_description":"Esperanza Homes builds high-quality, beautiful homes in Weslaco. Perfectly positioned in the Rio Grande Valley, Weslaco gives residents convenient access to local dining, shopping and outdoor recreation. With our E-Difference—E-Connected, E-Efficient, E-Simplicity, and E-Customization—you''ll enjoy smart home features, long-term energy savings, and a homebuying experience tailored to your lifestyle in one of the Valley''s most welcoming cities.","live_in_heading":"Live in Weslaco, Texas","live_in_description":"Find your dream home in Weslaco at our Texas Heights community.","live_in_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/WeslacoRelax_3.jpg","image_0":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/WeslacoContent_1.jpg","section_1_title":"A City with History and Heart","section_1_description":"Weslaco is steeped in history, from its early days as an agricultural hub to the present there is always something happening in the city — including the Texas Onion Fest held once a year. The historic downtown district is home to locally owned shops and restaurants waiting to be explored.","section_1_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/WeslacoSee_2.jpg","section_1a_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/WeslacoRelax_3.jpg","section_2_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","section_2_description":"With its warm, sunny climate, residents and visitors can enjoy the great outdoors all year long. Weslaco is home to nature reserves like Estero Llano Grande State Park and the Valley Nature Center, offering endless opportunities for hiking, biking and birdwatching.","section_2_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/W0PbdPY4KoYDLCEG5Tt3V_80j7sVXVj8KtHHHk0bap8","section_3_title":"Life in Weslaco, Texas","section_3_description":"Weslaco offers food, entertainment and more. Read on to discover a few of our favorites.","section_3_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/epFjXu6brDRpEiDArI5JzG5KugtmY8vkvEbHRb8y6mU","pillar_1_title":"Strong Sense of Community","pillar_1_description":"The city is known for its authentic Tex-Mex cuisine, historic downtown, and vibrant local businesses.","pillar_2_title":"Rich Culture & Heritage","pillar_2_description":"Weslaco blends small-town charm with rich cultural traditions, offering a welcoming atmosphere for residents and visitors alike.","pillar_3_title":"More Home for Your Money","pillar_3_description":"Weslaco offers stability and opportunity for residents.","pillar_4_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","pillar_4_description":"With its prime location in the Rio Grande Valley, Weslaco provides easy access to scenic parks, wildlife refuges, and outdoor recreation."}','{"eat_venues":"Cortino''s Italian Restaurant\n[Nana''s Taqueria](https://www.facebook.com/people/Nanas-Taqueria-Weslaco-Tx/100067145984354/)\n[The Blue Onion](https://www.myblueonion.com/)\n","eat_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/WeslacoEat_2.jpg","shop_venues":"[Rio Grande Valley Premium Outlets](https://www.premiumoutlets.com/outlet/rio-grande-valley)\n","shop_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/WeslacoShop.jpg","play_venues":"[Weslaco Museum](https://weslacomuseum.org/)\n[Wesmer Drive-in Theater](https://www.wesmerdrivein.com/)\n[Texas Onion Fest](https://business.weslaco.com/events/details/texas-onion-fest-2023-21791)\n","play_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/WeslacoSee_2.jpg","relax_venues":"[Frontera Audubon Center](https://texastimetravel.com/directory/frontera-audubon-center/)\n[Valley Nature Center](https://www.valleynaturecenter.org/)\n[Santa Ana Natural Wildlife Refuge](https://www.fws.gov/refuge/santa-ana/visit-us/locations/santa-ana-national-wildlife-refuge)\n[Estero Llano Grande World Birding Center](https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/estero-llano-grande)\n","relax_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recW0wHzJdyeqLiA4/WeslacoRelax_3.jpg"}','2026-05-31T01:05:16.822Z','2026-05-31T02:25:41.182Z',NULL,1,0);
INSERT INTO "cities" ("id","community_count","move_in_homes_count","floor_plans_count","city_name","slug","state","status","map_latitude","map_longitude","hero_image_url","hero_description","national_recognition","incentive","city_copy_blocks_json","city_venue_blocks_json","created_at","updated_at","custom_fields","published","coming_soon") VALUES('recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt',4,37,67,'Mission','mission','TX','Active',26.2159,-98.3253,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/I6QjJCqKRmvvIP1X-oaLdrGsKYvBj-so5lOZqMYrVDo','Welcome to the City of Mission, Texas! From outdoor adventures to great shopping, Mission has something for everyone. Explore local boutiques and vibrant markets and celebrate the city''s rich traditions at annual events like the Texas Citrus Fiesta, Winter Texan Fiesta and Texas Butterfly Festival. Looking for good food? Check out Ana Liz Taqueria, winner of the James Beard Award for Best Chef in Texas!','Ana Liz Taqueria, winner of the James Beard Award for Best Chef in Texas',NULL,'{"homes_heading":"Our Homes in Mission","homes_description":"Esperanza Homes builds high-quality, energy-efficient homes throughout Mission, with a range of floor plans and personalized features to match every lifestyle. Through our E-Difference—E-Connected, E-Efficient, E-Simplicity, and E-Customization—we bring smart technology, sustainable living, and a seamless homebuying experience to one of the most vibrant and well-located cities in South Texas","live_in_heading":"Live in Mission, Texas","live_in_description":"Find your dream home in our numerous Mission Communities! From Retama Village (55+), Sendero and Tanglewood Bentsen Palm has homes for every lifestyle.","live_in_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/MissionSee3_1.jpg","image_0":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/MissionSee3.jpg","section_1_title":"A Celebration of Culture and Heritage","section_1_description":"Founded in the late 1700s, this city is home to several historic landmarks, including the iconic La Lomita Chapel and the Mission Historical Museum, which offers an immersive experience into the city''s past. Plus, the city''s proximity to the Mexican border means that you can explore a unique blend of Texan and Mexican culture.","section_1_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/MissionRelax.jpg","section_1a_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/MissionSee2.jpg","section_2_title":"Nature Lovers Paradise","section_2_description":"For outdoor enthusiasts, Mission is a paradise. The city is surrounded by lush nature reserves, such as the Bentsen-Rio Grande Valley State Park, and National Butterfly Center, where visitors can hike, bike, and birdwatch to their heart''s content.","section_2_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/Kw49xDCR2Zir4XVMBt9ZlqrSJjD-5aqanDuRYNyVqM8","section_3_title":"Life in Mission, Texas","section_3_description":"Mission has a vibrant mix of entertainment, food and outdoor activities. Read on to discover a few of our favorites.","section_3_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/yzOjQipc1v_jnyRRsW8sQntrF6kVB5DBX65tzr6jk8M","pillar_1_title":"Prime Location","pillar_1_description":"Easy access to top schools, shopping, and expressway, plus a unique blend of Texan and Mexican culture.","pillar_2_title":"Strong Sense of Community","pillar_2_description":"Mission''s rich history, cultural heritage, and annual festivals create a welcoming and vibrant atmosphere.","pillar_3_title":"More Home for your Money","pillar_3_description":"A thriving job market and low cost of living makes Mission an ideal place to live and invest in a home.","pillar_4_title":"We Love the Mission!","pillar_4_description":"Our roots are in the Rio Grande Valley, where our very first community began in Mission a legacy that continues to grow."}','{"eat_venues":"[Ana Liz Taqueria](https://www.facebook.com/analiztaqueria/)\n[The Loretto at Mission](https://www.lorettobistro.com/)\n[The Griffin Grill](https://thegriffingrillrgv.com/)\n","eat_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/MissionEat.jpg","shop_venues":"[Sharyland Towne Crossing](https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=bf8b1e6e2320e182&rlz=1C1GCEA_enUS1102US1102&sxsrf=AHTn8zpUO808rwvfoknHtg7UcV6JZlGAYA:1742921774003&kgmid=/g/1tqty9gr&q=Sharyland+Towne+Crossing&shndl=30&shem=lcuae,uaasie&source=sh/x/loc/uni/m1/1&kgs=d5f98ab24214cb0f)\nSouthern Roots Market\n","shop_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/MissionShop.jpg","play_venues":"[City Of Mission Hike and Bike Trail](https://www.google.com/search?rlz=1C1GCEA_enUS1102US1102&sca_esv=1a9c224e5a61e56f&cs=0&output=search&tbm=lcl&kgmid=/g/11bcclt6bs&q=City+Of+Mission+Hike+and+Bike+Trail+Park+Entrance&shndl=30&source=sh/x/kp/local/m1/1&kgs=bfda71ba5510a712)\n[La Lomita Mission](https://missiontexas.us/life-in-mission/attractions/la-lomita-chapel/)\n[Mission Historical Museum](https://missionmuseum.org/)\n[Veterans Memorial](https://missiontexas.us/life-in-mission/attractions/veterans-memorial/)\n","play_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/MissionSee3_2.jpg","relax_venues":"[National Butterfly Center](https://www.nationalbutterflycenter.org/)\n[Bentsen-Rio Grande Valley State Park and World Birding Center](https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/bentsen-rio-grande-valley)\n","relax_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recXEfaDLyZ0ibeUt/MissionRelax.jpg"}','2026-05-31T01:05:16.822Z','2026-05-31T02:25:41.182Z',NULL,1,0);
INSERT INTO "cities" ("id","community_count","move_in_homes_count","floor_plans_count","city_name","slug","state","status","map_latitude","map_longitude","hero_image_url","hero_description","national_recognition","incentive","city_copy_blocks_json","city_venue_blocks_json","created_at","updated_at","custom_fields","published","coming_soon") VALUES('recfSL7jdwSsqkbPN',0,0,NULL,'Corpus Christi','corpus-christi','TX','Coming Soon',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Welcome to Corpus Christi! A vibrant coastal city where laid-back beach living meets everyday convenience. Known for its scenic bayfront, growing economy, and strong sense of community, Corpus Christi offers a lifestyle that’s both relaxed and connected.',NULL,NULL,'{"homes_heading":"Our Homes in Corpus Christi","live_in_heading":"Live in Corpus Christi, Texas","live_in_description":"Find your dream home along the coast with Esperanza Homes.","section_1_title":"A Celebration of Culture and Heritage","section_1_description":"Corpus Christi is rich in culture, shaped by its coastal roots and vibrant blend of traditions. From local art and live music to coastal cuisine and community festivals, the city offers experiences that reflect its unique identity. \n\nResidents can explore waterfront attractions like Texas State Aquarium and USS Lexington Museum or enjoy annual events such as Buc Days that bring the community together. Whether you''re discovering local flavors or enjoying time-honored traditions, Corpus Christi offers a lifestyle full of character and connection. ","section_1_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recfSL7jdwSsqkbPN/Corpus_Celebration.webp","section_2_title":"Outdoor Lifestyle","section_2_description":"Life in Corpus Christi is built around the outdoors. With warm coastal weather year-round, residents can spend more time enjoying everything from beach days to bayfront strolls. \n\nExplore miles of shoreline at Padre Island National Seashore, take in scenic views along Corpus Christi Bayfront, or spend weekends fishing, boating, and paddleboarding on the water. For nature lovers, nearby parks and coastal preserves offer endless opportunities to relax, recharge, and stay active. \n\nWhether it’s an early morning walk by the water or a sunset by the shore, Corpus Christi makes it easy to enjoy an outdoor lifestyle every day.","section_2_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recfSL7jdwSsqkbPN/ep-Urlx5HcPFQWDsXIb8wcYTdnRko9Ok4ZJgHgM6rDo","section_3_title":"Life in Corpus Christi, Texas","section_3_description":"Corpus Christi offers the perfect blend of coastal beauty, modern convenience, and vibrant culture. From relaxing days at Padre Island National Seashore to exploring local attractions like Texas State Aquarium, there’s always something to experience. With a growing economy, welcoming community, and year-round outdoor lifestyle, it’s a place where you can truly feel at home.","pillar_1_title":"Coastal Lifestyle","pillar_1_description":"Enjoy miles of beautiful shoreline, waterfront views, and year-round outdoor activities that make everyday living feel like a getaway.","pillar_2_title":"Strong & Growing Economy","pillar_2_description":"With key industries like energy, healthcare, tourism, and one of the nation’s largest ports, Corpus Christi offers long-term opportunity and stability.\n\n","pillar_3_title":"Convenient Location","pillar_3_description":"Easily connected to major highways, local employers, and regional destinations, making commuting and travel simple and accessible.","pillar_4_title":"Vibrant Community","pillar_4_description":"From local events and dining to family-friendly communities and schools, Corpus Christi offers a welcoming environment for every stage of life."}','{"eat_venues":"[Water Street Oyster Bar](https://waterstreetoysterbar.com/#oyster-home)\n[Harrison’s Landing](https://harrisonslanding.net/)\n[Executive Surf Club](https://www.executivesurfclub.com/)\n","eat_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recfSL7jdwSsqkbPN/Corpus_Eat.webp","shop_venues":"[La Palmera](https://www.lapalmera.com/)\n[Crossroads Shopping Village](https://www.facebook.com/CrossroadsShoppingVillage/)\n[Vintage & Antique](https://www.visitcorpuschristi.com/blog/post/thrift-vintage-antique-shopping-in-corpus-christi/)\n","shop_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recfSL7jdwSsqkbPN/Corpus_Shop.webp","play_venues":"[Texas State Aquarium](https://www.texasstateaquarium.org/)\n[USS Lexington Museum](https://usslexington.com/)\n[Corpus Christi Museum of Science & History](https://www.ccmuseum.com/)\n","play_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recfSL7jdwSsqkbPN/Corpus_Play.webp","relax_venues":"[Beaches](https://www.visitcorpuschristi.com/beaches/)\n[South Texas Botanical Gardens & Nature Center](https://stxbot.org/)\n[Birdiest City in America](https://www.visitcorpuschristi.com/things-to-do/birding/)\n","relax_image":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/cities/recfSL7jdwSsqkbPN/Corpus_Relax.webp"}','2026-05-31T01:05:16.822Z','2026-05-31T02:25:41.182Z',NULL,1,1);
