 of living space, the entry opens into a light-filled living area, dining room, and kitchen, with a private covered patio where you can start the day with your morning coffee. There''s an island and a good-size pantry in the incredible kitchen which connects to the double garage for convenience. All three bedrooms are set at the rear of the floorplan including your luxe master haven with a walk-in closet and a private master bath. A second full bath services the guest bedrooms while the utility room is large and well-equipped. Upgrades to the kitchen and glass sliding doors to the patio would delight the avid entertainer and you can choose to upgrade the master bath and utility room. A Contemporary or Transitional elevation is also on offer in this stylish villa.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/cortono','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=cy4p3tZR78P',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/cortono','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/26/Cortono_3072025.pdf',120.67,208.5,87.83,'Cielo Vista, Villas at La Sienna, Villas at Tres Lagos',3,'recOQCvJlqw3yXl4d,reczcM4whWGYX0Ev4,recsNMfSvJRk6KPPS,recX3zRvsi0zKSwPC,recK1Xjx6LQbwDP7R,recxXZB1WcWaKjiNT,recH0tRwrI3wYnFxk,recSTXveqCSXqXVuV',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
