eating a natural flow between the kitchen, dining, and family spaces-perfect for everyday living and effortless entertaining.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/bluebonnet',NULL,NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/bluebonnet',NULL,122.25,208.25,86,NULL,0,'recvVaiciSPZS6x4j,recopGjFJuuDAXd8W,recWdMZTf7YqT8Z0F,recclOZeip6o2L3ta,reclsKv5NomwClxOc,recIHEKkMmPbgQd6h,reciPYQwJZTjpFOUd,recNcEjpqPKtnrKHW,recND0x6smW7n35Rl,recXZreQAwFhahdPo,recJmV5GPpdE2BcDY,recFBYlHo1oPFX2qM,recSqWR2T7uUF5gQ2,rec3s5CwtfZAZPK7j,recPW178F9aL81Trx,recuCzpUbNBll7ThS',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
