h comfort and function for everyday living. A welcoming entryway on the first floor leads to an open-concept layout with the family room, dining area, and the heart of the home—the kitchen. A covered patio gives you extra space to enjoy the outdoors. There''s also a powder room and a 2-car garage for added storage and convenience. Upstairs, all bedrooms are located together, making it ideal for families who want to stay close. The private primary suite has a large walk-in closet and a full bathroom with two sinks and a walk-in shower. Two more bedrooms share a full bathroom, and the laundry area is close by for easy access. *Window treatments and washer and dryer shown in photos and virtual tours are for staging purposes only and are not included with the home.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/allegrini','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=hH4nxd6DwsC',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/allegrini','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/7/3/Alligrini_5292025.pdf',125.17,219,93.83,'Cielo Vista, Villas at La Sienna, Villas at Tres Lagos',3,'recM6fVG8KFYWyDxh,recaUg7iRzplEwaLT,rec9ixf6qC8daD4pP,rec57Ls3nBodfDHOF,recpZGSakz81EqErE',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
