hree great-sized bedrooms and two bathrooms including the master suite with a walk-in closet, views over the backyard, and a stylish master bath offering a spacious vanity sink and a shower. Both the guest bedrooms have easy access to a full bath plus there''s a utility room and an attached two-car garage for absolute convenience. A formal dining room is located just off the entry and enjoys easy access to the chef''s kitchen and a light-filled family room. Here, you can kick back and relax with all your favorite people or move outside to the optional covered patio and admire views over the backyard. Add your own personal touch and style to the home with four elevation options to choose from including Farmhouse, Tuscan, Traditional and Contemporary.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/san_luis','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=xDBtnGoVYnN',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/san-luis','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2023/2/15/San_Luis_01.pdf',115.33,198,82.67,'Palo Alto Groves, Texas Heights, Sendero at Bentsen Palm, Paso Real, Stewart Coves, Harvest Coves, Las Brisas at Tres Lagos, El Eden',8,'recpWL96tQ9BkDXcl,recrt9ed4xJmAyXjw,recHjqnPUN515Xjdb,rec0SG8uYSJ7uDJRZ,recm9YdKVCW01Ylmn,rec8wTkHy4cWU2ze8,reciKR2S4aAyUzkId,recW9IFR2hwjLZnWn,recdMHgKUnaDZLS4N,recwigdNulnC9W3or,recNG0CTmy10JSKh0,recZAHs9lDYJM2JLl,recl6eBo1qYi57100',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
