.r2.dev/floor_plans/rec2uf7c2GThHoomI/1-13_y2UU7zR.jpg","filename":"1-13_y2UU7zR.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'Designed with modern living in mind, this two-story villa is a stunning home anyone would love returning to each and every day. Depending on your own personal style, you can choose from a Contemporary or Transitional elevation to set the tone for your new home. The first floor houses an expansive kitchen, dining and living room with oversized windows and direct access to the covered patio. A walk-in pantry, an island and quality appliances will make preparing meals a pleasure in the kitchen. There is a main-floor powder room, utility room and a large master suite with an oversized walk-in closet and a master bath with a double vanity. A game room is set at the top of the stairs and leads to the two guest bedrooms with walk-in closets. The long list of features includes a second-floor full bath and storage room, a two-car garage and the option to add a study for those who work from home.2,211 Living Sq. Ft','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/grapa','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=oF9ZwbnCwqA',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/grapa','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/26/Grapa_3072025.pdf',144.17,261.92,117.75,'Cielo Vista, Villas at La Sienna, Villas at Tres Lagos',3,'rec1c1QARp4uQzKSD',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
