5.r2.dev/floor_plans/rec7V9RjfumZdNQYT/Kestrel_Tuscan_Stucco.jpg","filename":"Kestrel_Tuscan_Stucco.jpg"}]','[{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/rec7V9RjfumZdNQYT/Kestrel_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg","filename":"Kestrel_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/rec7V9RjfumZdNQYT/Kestrel_Farmhouse.jpg","filename":"Kestrel_Farmhouse.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/rec7V9RjfumZdNQYT/Kestrel_Traditional_Brick.jpg","filename":"Kestrel_Traditional_Brick.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/rec7V9RjfumZdNQYT/Kestrel_Tuscan_Stucco.jpg","filename":"Kestrel_Tuscan_Stucco.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Meet the Kestrel, the newest addition to our Harbor Home Collection-designed for first-time buyers, young families, and anyone ready to begin their homeownership journey with confidence and style. With 1,101 sq. ft. of living space, this single-story floor plan delivers a smart, efficient layout that feels open, comfortable, and easy to live in. Featuring 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, the Kestrel prioritizes functionality without sacrificing the modern design and thoughtful details Esperanza Homes is known for. A bright, open-concept living area anchors the home, creating the perfect space for family time, daily routines, and welcoming friends. Choose the elevation style that fits your personality-Contemporary, Farmhouse, Tuscan, or Traditional-each offering its own inviting curb appeal.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/kestrel',NULL,NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/kestrel','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2026/1/26/Kestrel_1282025.pdf',107.42,182.25,74.83,'Los Prados',1,'rec1RWjVgcf97mWmp,rec1O6Vq8tkqxrmv5,rechNw0hUroG78D8l,recyQe7oB2VQ5e3V0,recahGweoWmg72mtn,recmkIIjwRQ1JFyFm,recEqF8kbizQT3gVm,recfQ8a8xu1vKRsEn,recqaV1ZIjFTPvURP,recL8Hpqa8cq8UvDu,