appliances, add a second master bedroom to the main floor or add a powder room/full bath to the second floor.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/cypress','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=e5fQNQWwKGo',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/cypress','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/25/Cypress_3072025.pdf',119.17,206.42,87.25,'Retama Village (55+) at Bentsen Palm',1,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
