recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-6_qaiWu0K.jpg","filename":"1-6_qaiWu0K.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-7_PCsQfum.jpg","filename":"1-7_PCsQfum.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-9_r9wlUYS.jpg","filename":"1-9_r9wlUYS.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-11_PzFvVUk.jpg","filename":"1-11_PzFvVUk.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-13_7b5xlY0.jpg","filename":"1-13_7b5xlY0.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-14_1FjWTyI.jpg","filename":"1-14_1FjWTyI.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-15_KmaX36E.jpg","filename":"1-15_KmaX36E.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-16_2CR4Z5E.jpg","filename":"1-16_2CR4Z5E.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-17_Df8Jj2v.jpg","filename":"1-17_Df8Jj2v.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-18_zktL1ER.jpg","filename":"1-18_zktL1ER.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recBANjDwsdZr3E81/1-19_LABbiry.jpg","filename":"1-19_LABbiry.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'This two-story villa has been designed with the ultimate modern lifestyle in mind, with spacious and light-filled living zones that invite you to kick back and relax in style. With 2,006 square feet of living space, this floor plan features 3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms plus a selection of versatile living spaces. From the entry, you''re drawn into the open-concept kitchen, dining and living zone with direct access to a central covered patio as standard. A walk-in pantry, quality appliances and an island are ready for the eager cook and there''s a main-floor powder room, utility room and two-car garage. The master, with a walk-in closet and ensuite, is set on the first floor while upstairs you''ll discover two bedrooms, with walk-in closets, a full bath and a game room. Choose from either a Contemporary or Transitional elevation which best matches your style, plus you could add sliding doors to the covered patio and upgraded kitchen appliances.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/nikola','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=74g8jmZ4hUC',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/nikola','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/26/Nikola_3072025.pdf',136.58,252.5,115.92,'Villas at La Sienna, Villas at Tres Lagos',2,'recBgWfq6BdHmN68p,recC8sfHLH7N3cO7p,recQjK5HqODSoHjOx,recNgnm0IffAT02PW',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
