h dual vanities, and a walk-in shower. A secondary bedroom and full bath offer comfortable accommodation for guests or family. Additional highlights include a covered patio, utility room, walk-in pantry and a 2-car garage.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/lunelli','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=iFAUpHwtWdr',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/lunelli','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/5/30/Lunelli_5292025.pdf',100.25,158.08,57.83,'Villas at La Sienna, Villas at Tres Lagos',2,'reckdSViVzPjtvjCb',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
