d cabinets in your laundry room for more storage and style. *Window treatments and washer and dryer shown in photos and virtual tours are for staging purposes only and are not included with the home.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/benanti','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=eM6xmA14DNh',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/benanti','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/5/30/Benanti_5292025.pdf',143.25,256.5,113.25,'Cielo Vista, Villas at La Sienna, Villas at Tres Lagos',3,'recEQE2MC53ZBCDCo,recovKX6fzWcPavv6,recCSDZf9G3PG1ohi,rectFC9HuvCBN7eoX,recCzWKgpXrZyfXRR,recSlN9lewz6Kh4k3,recNPD1T4m3Zvk45v,recqCYMMFOmlA9X74,reckGigvGXchiCL85,recv7DmSOsnFjM5V3,recy8d8Vc7xijMSkq',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
