pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recSzcOLP6RduyLf7/Mulberry_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg","filename":"Mulberry_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg"}]','[{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recSzcOLP6RduyLf7/Mulberry_Traditional_Brick.jpg","filename":"Mulberry_Traditional_Brick.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recSzcOLP6RduyLf7/Mulberry_Tuscan_Stucco.jpg","filename":"Mulberry_Tuscan_Stucco.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recSzcOLP6RduyLf7/Mulberry_Farmhouse.jpg","filename":"Mulberry_Farmhouse.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recSzcOLP6RduyLf7/Mulberry_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg","filename":"Mulberry_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Mulberry is a spacious two-story home that gives families plenty of room to spread out, enjoy quiet time and make memories together. This 3-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom home is part of our popular Hearth Collection and can be upgraded to 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms.The first floor features an open-concept layout where the entryway leads into the family room, kitchen, and dining area. This open design makes it easy to cook, relax, and spend time with loved ones. The primary suite is located downstairs and includes a large walk-in closet and a private bathroom with dual sinks and a walk-in shower. A front-facing study provides a quiet space to work or read, with easy access to the powder room. Upstairs, two more bedrooms share a full bathroom, and one bedroom includes a walk-in closet. A hallway with built-in storage helps keep things neat and organizedThis floor plan features several upgrades, including a fourth bedroom and third full bathroom, an extended covered patio for outdoor living, a master bay in the primary bedroom, a freestanding tub in the primary bath for a spa-like retreat, and a garage storage extension. These upgrades make the home even more versatile, functional, and family-friendly.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/mulberry','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=9MtqEPTaHoE',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/mulberry','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/5/30/Mulberry_5292025.pdf',136.25,239.67,103.42,'Tanglewood at Bentsen Palm, Paso Real, Anaqua at Tres Lagos, Sapphire at La Sienna',4,'rechMkX0HmJY2J9is,recfo1Knmx6MFlXfe',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
