lans/recTl5CqugvCT4epL/1-7_qTmtlsX.jpg","filename":"1-7_qTmtlsX.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recTl5CqugvCT4epL/1-8_mhwnwGe.jpg","filename":"1-8_mhwnwGe.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recTl5CqugvCT4epL/1-9_9NMcylv.jpg","filename":"1-9_9NMcylv.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recTl5CqugvCT4epL/1-10_RsTDlff.jpg","filename":"1-10_RsTDlff.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'This stucco RV casita promises comfortable living and a stylish base to call home while you plan your next great adventure. The light-filled layout features one large bedroom and one bathroom along with an open-concept full kitchen, living and dining room that’s perfect for entertaining loved ones for hours on end. You can cook up a storm in the kitchen with quality appliances, sweeping granite countertops and an abundance of solid hardwood cabinetry as your friends relax in the living room or relish your gourmet creations in the dining area and look out over the backyard. A walk-in closet and laundry room add the finishing touches to the floorplan while tile flooring flows underfoot throughout and ensures this is the low-maintenance residence you’ve been dreaming of. Ready to park your pride and joy is the included RV pad with full hook-ups so you can rest easy as you dream up your next getaway.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/rv_casita','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=tWhRP9R4GJ4',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/rv-casita','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2024/11/15/Casita_1172024.pdf',87,132.67,45.67,'Retama Village (55+) at Bentsen Palm',1,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
