rary_Brick-05.jpg","filename":"063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-05.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recUDjjZN4VU6dh4H/063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-06.jpg","filename":"063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-06.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recUDjjZN4VU6dh4H/063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-07.jpg","filename":"063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-07.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recUDjjZN4VU6dh4H/063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-08.jpg","filename":"063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-08.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recUDjjZN4VU6dh4H/063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-09.jpg","filename":"063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-09.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recUDjjZN4VU6dh4H/063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-10.jpg","filename":"063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-10.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recUDjjZN4VU6dh4H/063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-11.jpg","filename":"063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-11.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recUDjjZN4VU6dh4H/063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-13.jpg","filename":"063025_5732_St_Dominic_Dr_Chacon_Contemporary_Brick-13.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'The Chacon is a warm and inviting home designed to be easy to love and simple to maintain. Featuring 4 bedrooms and 2 baths, this thoughtfully crafted floor plan combines modern design and smart use of space—perfect for you and your family. The Chacon floorplan is exclusive to Wolf Creek. The spacious front porch leads you into a welcoming foyer and open concept living area with access to your back yard. There is an optional upgrade of a covered patio to enjoy your private yard. Off the foyer, you''ll find three bedrooms, a full bathroom, a utility closet for your washer and dryer, a large walk-in hallway closet and a linen closet for extra storage. The primary suite is separated from the other bedrooms, which provides privacy. The ensuite features a single sink vanity with an option to upgrade to a dual sink, a separate enclosed toilet, and access to a spacious walk-in closet. This is your own personal retreat.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/chacon','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=aThLRbtka9g',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/chacon','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/4/11/Chacon_2252024.pdf',124.67,215.83,91.16,'Wolf Creek',1,'recBZwzYABpsixQer,rec46xugimaGL44xD,recWgydJTH32QdW7S,recXbFx09dBAGUA1x,recQLNx8fwM2eUQ8V,rec9d5mVKx4GPRMt3,reczKH1Fisc6PQzaQ,reckbbFOhCcxaaWjv',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
