filename":"6529_Anaqua_Loop_13.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recXleTIsns9ijCux/6529_Anaqua_Loop_14.jpg","filename":"6529_Anaqua_Loop_14.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recXleTIsns9ijCux/6529_Anaqua_Loop_15.jpg","filename":"6529_Anaqua_Loop_15.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'The Elm is a two-story home in our Hearth Collection that offers space, comfort, and flexibility. With over 2,500 square feet, this floor plan includes 4 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a private study. You can also upgrade to a 5th bedroom or add a casita to fit your family’s needs. The first floor features an open-concept kitchen, dining area, and family room with views of the backyard. The primary bedroom is on the first floor and includes a large walk-in closet and a bathroom with two sinks, and a walk-in shower. A study at the front of the home provides a quiet place to work, and a powder room is conveniently located for guests. Upstairs, a large Gameroom connects to three more bedrooms and a full bathroom. The upstairs is perfect for kids, teens or visitors. You can personalize the Elm with upgrades like a casita, extra bedroom and bathroom, freestanding tub, extended or grand covered patio, sliding glass doors, tray ceilings, added storage, extra cabinets, and upgraded kitchen appliances. The Elm has the space and options your family needs to live, grow, and enjoy every day.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/elm',NULL,NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/elm','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/10/15/Elm_10152025.pdf',158.83,293.33,134.5,'Tanglewood at Bentsen Palm, Paso Real, Anaqua at Tres Lagos, Sapphire at La Sienna',4,'recPwJIU6RP0Sgepp,recfKzWhiy2dEVuF1,recyn6bR6FOtPv2K8,recjTsZP95BRIcllO',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
