ecZIH7Gh61sYTTe1/Cimarron_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg","filename":"Cimarron_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg"}]','[{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZIH7Gh61sYTTe1/Cimarron_Tuscan_Stucco.jpg","filename":"Cimarron_Tuscan_Stucco.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZIH7Gh61sYTTe1/Cimarron_Traditional_Brick.jpg","filename":"Cimarron_Traditional_Brick.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZIH7Gh61sYTTe1/Cimarron_Farmhouse.jpg","filename":"Cimarron_Farmhouse.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZIH7Gh61sYTTe1/Cimarron_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg","filename":"Cimarron_Contemporary_Stucco.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Designed for grand living and lasting legacy, the Cimarron is a remarkable single-story home in our Homestead Home Collection that blends luxury, flexibility, and timeless design. With 3,072 sq. ft. of living space and 4,148 sq. ft. total, this stunning floor plan is crafted for those who want a home that truly grows with their family—today and for generations to come. The Cimarron features 4 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, and a 3-car garage, offering privacy and comfort for every member of the household. At the heart of the home, a beautifully designed courtyard creates a private outdoor sanctuary, while the covered patio extends the living experience outdoors for effortless entertaining. Inside, thoughtfully curated spaces—including a morning room, study, and computer nook—support both everyday routines and special moments.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/cimarron',NULL,NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/cimarron','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2026/1/2/Cimarron_12302025.pdf',168.75,322.17,153.42,'Aqualina at Tres Lagos, Sapphire at La Sienna',2,'rec3MUXHoWE1stdUJ,recpk90qCd5ZXufRn,recOtoF90ZtcJLiN4,recf92FD88yQzm1q2',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','