//pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZxX5SeCh9ZlHUX/1-9.jpg","filename":"1-9.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZxX5SeCh9ZlHUX/1-10.jpg","filename":"1-10.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZxX5SeCh9ZlHUX/1-11.jpg","filename":"1-11.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZxX5SeCh9ZlHUX/1-12.jpg","filename":"1-12.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZxX5SeCh9ZlHUX/1-13.jpg","filename":"1-13.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recZxX5SeCh9ZlHUX/1-14.jpg","filename":"1-14.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'The Acuna II is expertly designed for contemporary comfort. This gorgeous two-story home offers 1,975 sq. ft. of spacious, light-filled and open-concept living that is guaranteed to impress. As standard, there are three bedrooms including the main-floor master with a walk-in closet and a luxurious master bath with a double vanity and a walk-in shower. Both the bedrooms are housed upstairs with each offering a walk-in closet and easy access to a second full bath and the upstairs game room. Daily life will revolve around the generous kitchen, informal dining and family room with large windows that frame views over the yard. Any avid cook will adore the quality appliances and center island plus there''s a main-floor powder room, utility room and two-car garage. You can choose from four elevation options to suit your own personal style and vision plus there''s an option to convert the game room into a 4th bedroom!','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/acuna_ii','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=4RVYQdgfGtu',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/acuna-ii','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2024/12/3/AcunaII_1232024.pdf',132.75,252.83,120.08,'Texas Heights',1,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
