3917_Boykin_Creek_013.jpg","filename":"060725_Luna_Tuscan_Stucco_Portfolio_Photos_13917_Boykin_Creek_013.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recaICqnQSoFoCzEZ/060725_Luna_Tuscan_Stucco_Portfolio_Photos_13917_Boykin_Creek_014.jpg","filename":"060725_Luna_Tuscan_Stucco_Portfolio_Photos_13917_Boykin_Creek_014.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recaICqnQSoFoCzEZ/060725_Luna_Tuscan_Stucco_Portfolio_Photos_13917_Boykin_Creek_018.jpg","filename":"060725_Luna_Tuscan_Stucco_Portfolio_Photos_13917_Boykin_Creek_018.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'Discover the Luna floor plan - a spacious one-story oasis designed for entertaining. With 2,279 sq. ft. of living space, this home provides ample room for a family to spread out and enjoy an open concept living area and spacious bedrooms. At the heart of the home, a courtyard and optional extended covered patio seamlessly blends indoor and outdoor living, creating an ideal space for relaxation or gatherings. Want more? Upgrade to include a private casita with its own bathroom and closet for added luxury. At the entrance, a large study, powder room, and two bedrooms with a shared full bathroom are conveniently located. The generously sized family room, with its wall of windows, brings in natural light and provides a sense of connection to the outdoors. The attached kitchen and dining room offer views of the courtyard patio. A large pantry just off the kitchen sits conveniently next to the utility room. The private and secluded primary bedroom is bordered by the courtyard on one side and the backyard on the other, offering outdoor views with abundant natural light. A spacious primary bathroom leads to a large walk-in closet. The bathroom includes two sinks, a private toilet room and a linen closet for extra storage.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/luna','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=HcH1R2Poa4g',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/luna','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/25/Luna_03072025.pdf',140.17,237.58,97.41,'Retama Village (55+) at Bentsen Palm, Tanglewood at Bentsen Palm, Paso Real, Anaqua at Tres Lagos, Sapphire at La Sienna',5,'rec0sbTJdNk5YfKmA,recDc72kUG9mHbOxe,recOvbI44uJKmcdK0',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
