o bedrooms, with walk-in closets, and two bathrooms including the master bath with a luxurious double vanity as standard. A study is set at the front of the floorplan, perfect for working from home, plus there''s a utility room and a large two-car garage with storage. A second master can be added in lieu of a study while the kitchen appliances can also be upgraded to ensure preparing meals for loved ones is an absolute pleasure.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/peppoli','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=2PhVUWKS37t',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/peppoli','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/26/Peppoli_2252025.pdf',106.67,176,69.33,'Villas at La Sienna, Villas at Tres Lagos',2,'recq0GXQzJWxRuxFQ,recOZRwLU9TN09R0p,recUCbRYqPSeIrxS8,recolueWUtCZLUUsv,recMPNf7tLLohRYBO,reclrNN7g7X0KPpJl,recFHX1RCiLiD7kOG',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
