305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recbi0ZIJPSLvjtz4/073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_08.jpg","filename":"073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_08.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recbi0ZIJPSLvjtz4/073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_09.jpg","filename":"073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_09.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recbi0ZIJPSLvjtz4/073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_010.jpg","filename":"073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_010.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recbi0ZIJPSLvjtz4/073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_011.jpg","filename":"073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_011.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recbi0ZIJPSLvjtz4/073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_012.jpg","filename":"073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_012.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recbi0ZIJPSLvjtz4/073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_013.jpg","filename":"073014_Ebony_Traditional_Stucco_3708_Heron_Way_013.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'Prepare to be amazed, the Ebony is an absolute show-stopper offering 1,176 living square feet. This stunning home includes two bedrooms and two bathrooms plus an attached 50ft RV port with hookups and direct access to the private courtyard. The layout revolves around the open-concept kitchen, dining and living room where you can choose to add French doors or a sliding door out to the patio. There is a large master with a walk-in closet and a deluxe master bath while bedroom two is just steps from a second full bath, computer nook and utility room. As standard, the kitchen already includes a walk-in pantry and ample counter space and you may also be keen to upgrade the appliances. Bedroom two could be converted into an optional second master suite and you may even wish to add a cozy fireplace to the living room. Ample storage options can also be added off the RV port.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/ebony',NULL,NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/ebony','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/25/Ebony_3072025.pdf',105.83,179.75,73.92,'Retama Village (55+) at Bentsen Palm',1,'recDseB74iSU6vPHK',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
