-08.jpg","filename":"082124_Palm_Traditional_Stucco-_3910_Humming_Bird_Lane-08.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/rechmvVglsjwFlPiV/082124_Palm_Traditional_Stucco-_3910_Humming_Bird_Lane-09.jpg","filename":"082124_Palm_Traditional_Stucco-_3910_Humming_Bird_Lane-09.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/rechmvVglsjwFlPiV/082124_Palm_Traditional_Stucco-_3910_Humming_Bird_Lane-10.jpg","filename":"082124_Palm_Traditional_Stucco-_3910_Humming_Bird_Lane-10.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'Who says easy-care living has to come at the expense of luxury? The Palm is designed to offer an indoor-outdoor lifestyle with the avid entertainer guaranteed to love the expansive covered patio and open-concept kitchen, dining and living zone. Cooking will be a pleasure with sweeping countertops and an island plus there’s the option to upgrade the appliances or add an outdoor kitchen. The 1,833sqft of living space floorplan has two bedrooms and 2.5 baths including the luxe master with dual walk-in closet and a master bath with a garden tub and dual vanities. Two bedrooms have a walk-in closet and an ensuite bath, there’s also a powder room, utility room, a cart garage and a two-car garage with storage. There are two elevations to choose from plus you can add a third bedroom or study in lieu of the cart garage. Sliding glass doors can open out to the patio while extra options include an entertainment center and bathroom upgrades.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/palm','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=z5MKFrFRbm7&help=1',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/palm','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/25/Palm_2252025.pdf',121.42,200.58,79.16,'Retama Village (55+) at Bentsen Palm',1,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
