ects to a large walk-in closet. The primary bath includes two sinks, an enclosed toilet for privacy and plenty of room to move around. The remaining three bedrooms, each with its own walk-in closet, share a centrally located bathroom.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/brazos','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=QF2XZYKAWUZ',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/brazos','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2024/10/1/Brazos_1002024.pdf',173.25,332.42,159.17,'Aqualina at Tres Lagos, Sapphire at La Sienna',2,'rec991MGjqOVVm2di,rec1GtDelWdhQqsZ9',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
