25_Aqualina_Model_Updated_6.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recnlVjhw9HO2JO59/110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_7.jpg","filename":"110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_7.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recnlVjhw9HO2JO59/110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_8.jpg","filename":"110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_8.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recnlVjhw9HO2JO59/110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_9.jpg","filename":"110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_9.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recnlVjhw9HO2JO59/110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_10.jpg","filename":"110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_10.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recnlVjhw9HO2JO59/110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_11.jpg","filename":"110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_11.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recnlVjhw9HO2JO59/110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_12.jpg","filename":"110325_Aqualina_Model_Updated_12.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'A stunning hacienda-style courtyard, with an optional hearth, instantly sets the tone for this must-see home. The incredible single-story floorplan boasts four bedrooms and four bathrooms including a guest casita with a private bath. The master suite overlooks the courtyard and is complete with a huge walk-in closet and a master bath with a garden tub and dual vanities. There is also a study while daily life is sure to revolve around the open-concept kitchen, dining and family room with an optional hearth. Here, you can cook up a storm in the kitchen before moving outside to the optional covered patio where you can choose to add an outdoor kitchen. All the guest bedrooms have attached bathrooms and there''s a utility room plus a large two-car garage. Depending on your lifestyle, you might even choose to add a computer nook, an extra bedroom and bathroom or additional parking space in the garage.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/capistrano','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=kXqjRSGgWKy',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/capistrano','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2024/11/1/Capistrano_10172024.pdf',167.92,316.92,149,'Aqualina at Tres Lagos',1,'recsstY8B7VITXWXG,recYAtYXuOWOtABkQ',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
