//pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recqtHpGxguWdzlRp/1-8_OQTgn7J.jpg","filename":"1-8_OQTgn7J.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recqtHpGxguWdzlRp/1-16_7RbdDXr.jpg","filename":"1-16_7RbdDXr.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recqtHpGxguWdzlRp/1-17.jpg","filename":"1-17.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recqtHpGxguWdzlRp/1-19_azBI0OB.jpg","filename":"1-19_azBI0OB.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recqtHpGxguWdzlRp/1-21_OLAcvfE.jpg","filename":"1-21_OLAcvfE.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recqtHpGxguWdzlRp/1-4.jpg","filename":"1-4.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recqtHpGxguWdzlRp/1-5.jpg","filename":"1-5.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'Guaranteed to tick every box on your ultimate property wishlist, this 2,208 sq. ft. stunning floorplan must be seen to be believed. You can take your pick from four elevation options along with a selection of impressive upgrades that will make this property feel like home. As standard, the floorplan features three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a study with the master boasting a walk-in closet and a dream master bath. The open kitchen, dining and family room, with an optional fireplace, is ready for the hustle and bustle of busy modern life and there''s a covered patio for hosting guests. You can upgrade the kitchen appliances, master bath and add a powder room while a fourth bedroom can be added in lieu of the study. There are different covered patio and garage options plus you can even add a second-floor game room, bonus room and bathroom to expand the floorplan even further.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/francisco_i','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=Hd5vjsGewjc',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/francisco-i','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/20/Francisco_1312025.pdf',144.58,254.17,109.59,'Paso Real',1,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
