_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_10.jpg","filename":"063025_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_10.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recrH7Mooev4s21M5/063025_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_11.jpg","filename":"063025_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_11.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recrH7Mooev4s21M5/063025_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_12.jpg","filename":"063025_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_12.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recrH7Mooev4s21M5/063025_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_13.jpg","filename":"063025_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_13.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recrH7Mooev4s21M5/063025_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_14.jpg","filename":"063025_5740_St_Dominic_Dr_Bear_Traditional_Brick-_14.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'The Bear is the perfect home for those who value smart, functional design without sacrificing style. This thoughtfully designed floor plan features 3 bedrooms, 2 baths, and plenty of storage space and is exclusive to Wolf Creek.Step into the welcoming foyer, which invites you into the open-concept kitchen, dining area and family room. The kitchen includes a center island with a dual sink, offering clear views of the living space and the outdoors. The kitchen includes a pantry and plenty of cabinet space for storage. There is an optional upgrade of a covered patio for your private backyard. To the left of the foyer, a hallway leads to two secondary bedrooms, a full bathroom, a coat closet, linen closet and a utility room for your washer and dryer. The primary bedroom entrance is located towards the back of the house, set apart from the other two bedrooms, allowing for greater privacy. The primary suite includes an ensuite bathroom and a large walk-in closet, creating a comfortable retreat away from the main living areas.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/bear','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=TQRDxT44fKL',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/bear','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2024/12/31/Bear_12312024.pdf',113.08,199.08,86,'Wolf Creek',1,'recJ4K666sHfmCSa6,recRoohctIP9WjK3r,recXbFP1P9c453rY1,recHEQH2DKgrqRGHa,recDRFpsOBJcb3V0C,recm48uQW2tutaOlt,recny5pGEkRxtf8DY,recdxxoKOS2GNJabH',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
