tunning 3,044 sq. ft. floorplan must be seen to be believed. You can take your pick from four elevation options along with a selection of impressive upgrades that will make this property feel like home. As standard, the floorplan features three bedrooms, three bathrooms , an upstairs game room, a study with the master boasting a walk-in closet and a dream master bath. The open kitchen, dining and family room, with an optional fireplace, is ready for the hustle and bustle of busy modern life and there’s a covered patio for hosting guests. You can upgrade the kitchen appliances, master bath and add a powder room while a fourth bedroom can be added in lieu of the study. There are different covered patio and garage options.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/francisco_ii','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=LHb8pq1s2tG',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/francisco-ii','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/20/Francisco_II_3072025.pdf',166.33,304.5,138.17,'Tanglewood at Bentsen Palm, Paso Real, Anaqua at Tres Lagos, Sapphire at La Sienna',4,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
