e574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recsmoEtIeqCSOdJp/Barbados_Tuscan.jpg","filename":"Barbados_Tuscan.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Live the life of luxury most people can only dream of in this two-story RV Port Home complete with four good-size bedrooms and three bathrooms across 2,177 square feet of living space. A private courtyard entrance welcomes you to the property where you will find a light-filled great room that invites you to kick back and relax. The kitchen overlooks the great room and features a walk-in pantry and a center island with the option to upgrade the appliances. Two bedrooms are set on this level including the master with a walk-in closet, a luxe master bath and the choice to add doors that open to the courtyard. Two additional bedrooms are housed on the upper level with a Jack-and-Jill bath for added convenience. You can take your pick from a wide range of optional extras including two elevations, an additional covered patio, cabinets in the utility room and a range of storage options off the 50ft covered RV port with full hook-ups.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/barbados',NULL,NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/barbados','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/19/Barbados_3072025.pdf',150.08,279.58,129.5,'Retama Village (55+) at Bentsen Palm',1,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
