05.r2.dev/floor_plans/recttDkh2D3ePKsOh/6601_Anaqua_Loop_12.jpg","filename":"6601_Anaqua_Loop_12.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recttDkh2D3ePKsOh/6601_Anaqua_Loop_13.jpg","filename":"6601_Anaqua_Loop_13.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recttDkh2D3ePKsOh/6601_Anaqua_Loop_14.jpg","filename":"6601_Anaqua_Loop_14.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'A featured home in our Hearth Collection, the Hickory is a charming single-story design offering 3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, with the flexibility to upgrade to 4 bedrooms and 3 full bathrooms. The inviting layout of the Hickory makes it the perfect backdrop for life’s most meaningful moments. Upon entry, the open concept living area and backyard views draw you into the heart of the home. The kitchen, dining area, and family room flow seamlessly together, all overlooking a spacious, covered patio. The private primary suite features a walk-in closet and a beautifully appointed bath with dual vanities, and a large walk-in shower. Two secondary bedrooms share a full bath, while a study and convenient powder room add versatility to the layout. A 2-car garage and generous storage throughout complete this beautiful home. Upgrades include a fourth bedroom and third full bath, a freestanding tub in the primary bath, elegant tray ceilings, a grand covered patio with a 3-panel sliding door, a master bay window in the primary bedroom, upgraded appliances and additional cabinetry, and an extended garage with built-in storage space.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/hickory',NULL,NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/hickory','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/5/30/Hickory_5292025.pdf',125.42,197.83,72.41,'Tanglewood at Bentsen Palm, Paso Real, Anaqua at Tres Lagos, Sapphire at La Sienna',4,'recVLyUup5ZJQC1ch,recFETEE4iLgOg7Pk,rec1YTIdyYqVKgXu1,rec26rpvYslCBYCI1,rec3OJtQPz9WHD6OF',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
