 and a master bath, with a garden tub, or you can upgrade the master bath to a luxurious haven. One of the three bedrooms could be transformed into a study plus there''s a utility room and a detached two-car garage that can be expanded into a three-car garage. Extra optional upgrades include a covered patio off the garage, a vestibule and a casita with a third bathroom and a walk-in closet.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/santa_cruz',NULL,NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/santa-cruz',NULL,72.92,137.42,64.5,NULL,0,'recqny3Mzqqlf3if6',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
