s://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recvky45HoXGM9LIJ/112224_Paloma_Farmhouse_1007_W._Fall_Aster_St_-10.jpg","filename":"112224_Paloma_Farmhouse_1007_W._Fall_Aster_St_-10.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recvky45HoXGM9LIJ/112224_Paloma_Farmhouse_1007_W._Fall_Aster_St_-11.jpg","filename":"112224_Paloma_Farmhouse_1007_W._Fall_Aster_St_-11.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recvky45HoXGM9LIJ/112224_Paloma_Farmhouse_1007_W._Fall_Aster_St_-12.jpg","filename":"112224_Paloma_Farmhouse_1007_W._Fall_Aster_St_-12.jpg"},{"url":"https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/floor_plans/recvky45HoXGM9LIJ/112224_Paloma_Farmhouse_1007_W._Fall_Aster_St_-13.jpg","filename":"112224_Paloma_Farmhouse_1007_W._Fall_Aster_St_-13.jpg"}]',NULL,NULL,'The Paloma boasts a stunning living space of 1,496 sq. ft., designed to cater to the needs of modern-day families. This home features 3 spacious bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a 2-car garage. With tile flooring throughout the open-concept layout, the Paloma offers a seamless fusion of style and functionality. The primary bathroom features a spacious closet and a vanity sink upgrade to add a touch of luxury to your daily routine. One of its standout features is the breathtaking courtyard, accessible through a charming porch, where you can relax and unwind. Moreover, the Paloma offers a range of upgrades! The luxury kitchen appliances upgrade is a perfect addition for those who love to cook and entertain in style. The covered extended patio is perfect for those who enjoy outdoor living, while the 2-panel slider in the master bedroom adds a touch of sophistication and direct access to the courtyard. Additional storage is also available to keep all your equipment and accessories organized and tidy.','https://main-esperanza-homes.idapro.cloud/flr_pln/paloma','https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=zQp4ujiLsXZ',NULL,'https://esperanza-pdf.round-base-ed8c.workers.dev/pdf/floorplan/paloma','https://media.esperanzahomes.com/153/2025/3/25/Paloma_2252025.pdf',118.17,202.92,84.75,'Palo Alto Groves, Texas Heights, Sendero at Bentsen Palm, Paso Real, Stewart Coves, Harvest Coves, Las Brisas at Tres Lagos',7,'rec2ix1Q8j4Ehf8tP,rec1dNSF8xcMiQQ7E,rectnjlMhWprcwF9P,recrOaeP6EkHlBSRk,recuauJTArFErdctW,recaYhyzpZXIMen1y,recEwImy7rR4QPeec,recfG1kriPXzRLB76',NULL,'2026-05-31T01:05:16.826Z','2026-05-31T20:12:00.806Z',NULL,0);
