INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(53,'collections','rec4XEwOsbi0rfSHX','content','update','The Homestead Collection blends timeless design with functional layouts for those who value both tradition and practicality. Featuring larger homesites and flexible floorplans, this collection is built for families who want space to grow. Average Total Square Feet: 3,820.','The Homestead Home Collection offers magnificent living, with larger homesites and an average total square footage of 3,820. Designed for those looking to build their legacy, these homes feature flexible layouts and an impressive array of structural upgrades. Select homes also include butler pantries and spacious 3-car garages, adding an extra touch of luxury and convenience. With timeless charm and modern sophistication, this collection is perfect for creating a home that grows with your family.','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:41:21.377Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(54,'collections','rec4XEwOsbi0rfSHX','header_image','update',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/collections/rec4XEwOsbi0rfSHX/sZUY7czbKIm2_adyozvQL8sFxlHAyt9EUc405SMZZfo','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:41:21.377Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(55,'collections','recN0HSwNsnv0IsqI','content','update','The Harbor Collection offers thoughtfully designed homes that balance comfort and affordability. With open layouts and modern features, these homes are perfect for first-time buyers or families just starting out. Average Total Square Feet: 1,376.','The Harbor Home Collection is designed with first-time buyers and growing families in mind. With an average total square footage of 1,376, these homes maximize living space by prioritizing functionality and comfort. Thoughtfully crafted layouts and energy-effi­cient features make this collection the perfect starting point for your homeownership journey.','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:41:36.478Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(56,'collections','recN0HSwNsnv0IsqI','header_image','update',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/collections/recN0HSwNsnv0IsqI/JwVoZGLh7kfUob0LiU09dlczIS7--C_TbmG0SiBSPoQ','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:41:36.478Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(57,'collections','recNiF6jss1nn0YmX','content','update','Rooted in regional charm, the Retama Collection highlights designs inspired by the culture and lifestyle of the Rio Grande Valley. With versatile floorplans, these homes are thoughtfully crafted for 55+ active adult communities that combine comfort and convenience. Average Total Square Feet: 2,137.','The Retama Home Collection is all about maximizing potential, with designs inspired by the vibrant culture and lifestyle of the Rio Grande Valley. With an average total square footage of 2,137, these homes feature versatile floor plans thoughtfully crafted for 55+ active adult communities, combining comfort and convenience. For those with a spirit of adventure, select homes that even include space for your RV, making it easier than ever to explore and embrace life to the fullest.','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:42:07.791Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(58,'collections','recNiF6jss1nn0YmX','header_image','update',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/collections/recNiF6jss1nn0YmX/azbncHb71g-a-ZzkDRyCSIk0VbJmLbTpUQXi_Hna5FY','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:42:07.791Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(59,'collections','recqvmbgLIkEbgbIr','content','update','Centered around family and connection, the Hearth Collection emphasizes spacious living areas and flexible spaces to fit every stage of life. Thoughtful details make these homes warm, inviting, and ideal for creating lasting memories. Average Total Square Feet: 2,991.','The Hearth Home Collection is designed to be the heart of your family’s story. With an average total square footage of 2,991, these homes offer spacious layouts perfect for gathering, entertaining, and creating cherished memories. Timeless designs and energy-efficient features ensure your home is as welcoming as it is functional.','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:42:30.901Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(60,'collections','recqvmbgLIkEbgbIr','header_image','update',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/collections/recqvmbgLIkEbgbIr/1zcSthtWVe3rlk9bG7cOnoZd4dW9XDnq_mJLrnjWESw','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:42:30.901Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(61,'collections','recrCCKYiMwagvCBC','content','update','The Haven Collection delivers cozy, low-maintenance living without sacrificing quality. Perfect for downsizers, young professionals, or families seeking convenience, these homes combine efficiency, comfort, and modern design. Average Total Square Feet: 2,250.','Perfect for downsizers, young professionals, or families seeking convenience, the Haven Home Collection offers the ideal balance of efficiency, comfort, and modern design. With an average total square footage of 2,250, these homes provide spacious yet manageable layouts, making them the perfect retreat for any stage of life.','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:42:48.966Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(62,'collections','recrCCKYiMwagvCBC','header_image','update',NULL,'https://pub-9c9bfee574a54b62b2623e361b3ad305.r2.dev/collections/recrCCKYiMwagvCBC/OXRKmvI2CVRWxaxiUxJoKMtEHLG4vvKEP6zkzJxpANw','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:42:48.966Z');
INSERT INTO "audit_log" ("id","entity","entity_id","field","action","old_value","new_value","actor","at") VALUES(63,'collections','recurqAlya3R45PCw','content','update','The Villas Collection provides modern, lock-and-leave convenience with upscale design. Perfect for busy professionals or those seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle, these homes pair smart layouts with stylish finishes in prime locations. Average Total Square Feet: 2,146.','The Villas Home Collection is perfect for those who value style, simplicity, and convenience. With an average total square footage of 2,146, these homes offer a low-maintenance lifestyle paired with upscale designs and modern finishes. Located in prime areas near parks, retail, restaurants, and more, this collection ensures you’re always close to the amenities that make life easy. Experience the perfect blend of elegance and practicality with the Villas Home Collection.','fhammerly@rhodes.com','2026-06-05T15:43:06.710Z');
